msgid "每 {C:EquipTickSystem.RUST_IV} 秒甩出一道剑气，造成（60/75/100% 攻击力+40/60/100×暴击率）物理伤害。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipTickSystem.RUST_IV} seconds, flings a sword wave that deals (60/75/100% Attack + 40/60/100 × Crit Chance) physical damage."

msgid "【法力】充满时连斩随机敌人 5/6/8 次。溢出的治疗转化为血护盾。"
msgstr "[Mana] When full, slashes random enemies 5/6/8 times. Overflow healing becomes a Blood Shield."

msgid "登场时获得自身最大生命值 {C:MagicShield.SEAWEED_MAXHP_PCT%}% 的魔法护盾。每 {C:EquipTickSystem.JELLY_IV} 秒获得 {C:EquipTickSystem.JELLY_SHIELD}+自身最大生命值 {C:EquipTickSystem.JELLY_MAXHP_PCT%}% 的护盾，持续 {C:BattleDamage.COMMON_SHIELD_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "On spawn, gains a Magic Shield equal to {C:MagicShield.SEAWEED_MAXHP_PCT%}% of max health. Every {C:EquipTickSystem.JELLY_IV} seconds, gains a {C:EquipTickSystem.JELLY_SHIELD} + {C:EquipTickSystem.JELLY_MAXHP_PCT%}% max health shield for {C:BattleDamage.COMMON_SHIELD_SEC} seconds."

msgid "每次被攻击或技能命中时叠加 1 层硬化，每层提供 1/1.5/2 护甲和魔抗（上限 {C:EquipSystem.URCHIN_CAP} 层），层数达到上限时获得护盾。"
msgstr "Gains 1 Harden stack whenever hit by an attack or ability. Each stack grants 1/1.5/2 Armor and Magic Resist (max {C:EquipSystem.URCHIN_CAP} stacks). At max stacks, gains a shield."

msgid "每次被攻击或技能命中时叠加 1 层硬化，每层提供 {C:EquipTickSystem.FORTRESS_HARDEN_INC} 护甲和魔抗。达到 {C:EquipTickSystem.FORTRESS_CAP} 层后，每 {C:EquipTickSystem.FORTRESS_IV} 秒对全体敌人汲取生命。"
msgstr "Gains 1 Harden stack whenever hit by an attack or ability, each granting {C:EquipTickSystem.FORTRESS_HARDEN_INC} Armor and Magic Resist. At {C:EquipTickSystem.FORTRESS_CAP} stacks, drains health from all enemies every {C:EquipTickSystem.FORTRESS_IV} seconds."

msgid "每反伤 300/270/230 点获得护盾，并使下次攻击施加 30/50/90 层流血。反伤命中时，对目标施加 {C:ThornCut.AMP_CUT%}% 治疗削减和护盾削减，持续 {C:ThornCut.CUT_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "For every 300/270/230 damage reflected, gains a shield and the next attack applies 30/50/90 Bleed. Reflected hits apply {C:ThornCut.AMP_CUT%}% Grievous Wounds and shield reduction for {C:ThornCut.CUT_SEC} seconds."

msgid "受到的非真实伤害每段减少 3/6/10 点。每 {C:EquipTickSystem.IRONWALL_IV} 秒生成一份护盾，由全队分摊。"
msgstr "Reduces each instance of non-true damage taken by 3/6/10. Every {C:EquipTickSystem.IRONWALL_IV} seconds, creates a shield split across the team."

msgid "免疫击飞与斩杀。治疗友军积累充能，攻击消耗充能，击飞并眩晕最近的敌人。"
msgstr "Immune to knock-ups and executes. Healing allies builds charge; attacks spend it to knock up and stun the nearest enemy."

msgid "每 {C:EquipTickSystem.SHELL_IV} 秒回复 30/45/60+自身最大生命值 5/9/15% 的生命值。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipTickSystem.SHELL_IV} seconds, heals 30/45/60 + 5/9/15% of max health."

msgid "每 {C:EquipTickSystem.ANEMONE_IV} 秒治疗自身与生命百分比最低的友军。每累计提供 200/180/150 点治疗获得 1 层海葵。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipTickSystem.ANEMONE_IV} seconds, heals itself and the ally with the lowest health percentage. Gains 1 Anemone stack for every 200/180/150 healing provided."

msgid "每 {C:EquipTickSystem.DUMBBELL_IV} 秒获得 1 层锻炼，使最大生命值+40/75/110，并投掷哑铃击飞最近的敌人。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipTickSystem.DUMBBELL_IV} seconds, gains 1 Workout stack for +40/75/110 Max Health and throws a dumbbell that knocks up the nearest enemy."

msgid "攻击命中后，施加 7.5/10/15% 攻击力的流血层数。"
msgstr "On hit, applies Bleed stacks equal to 7.5/10/15% of Attack."

msgid "每 {C:EquipTickSystem.BARNACLE_IV} 秒连接攻击力最高的友军，为其承受 25/40/60% 的攻击与技能伤害。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipTickSystem.BARNACLE_IV} seconds, tethers to the ally with the highest Attack and takes 25/40/60% of the attack and ability damage dealt to it."

msgid "每 {C:EquipSystem.EMBER_IV} 秒抛出火瓶，造成 40/60/100 真实伤害并施加真火，持续 {C:EquipSystem.EMBER_TRUEFIRE_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipSystem.EMBER_IV} seconds, throws a fire flask that deals 40/60/100 true damage and applies True Flame for {C:EquipSystem.EMBER_TRUEFIRE_SEC} seconds."

msgid "攻击额外施加灼烧。【法力】充满时挥出火焰波，施加灼烧。"
msgstr "Attacks also apply Burn. [Mana] When full, sweeps out a fire wave that applies Burn."

msgid "每 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.EQ_TICK} 秒积累 1 层吐息，达到 3 层时召唤喷火龙贯穿全场，对沿途敌人造成（45/80/120+100% 攻击力）魔法伤害并施加灼烧，为沿途友军与自身回复（45/80/120+100% 攻击力）生命值。"
msgstr "Gains 1 Breath stack every {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.EQ_TICK} seconds. At 3 stacks, summons a fire dragon that sweeps across the field, dealing (45/80/120 + 100% Attack) magic damage and applying Burn to enemies in its path, and healing allies in its path and itself for (45/80/120 + 100% Attack)."

msgid "每 {C:EquipTickSystem.THUNDER_IV} 秒降下 1/2/3 道雷，每道造成 100% 攻击力真实伤害。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipTickSystem.THUNDER_IV} seconds, calls down 1/2/3 lightning bolts, each dealing 100% Attack as true damage."

msgid "【法力】充满时发射连锁闪电，共命中 7/10/15 次。"
msgstr "[Mana] When full, fires chain lightning that hits 7/10/15 times in total."

msgid "每 3 秒充能一次，下一次攻击追加 30/40/50 魔法伤害并眩晕目标。"
msgstr "Charges every 3 seconds. The next attack deals 30/40/50 bonus magic damage and stuns the target."

msgid "每 {C:IceSystem.VIAL_IV} 秒抛出冰瓶，造成（{C:IceSystem.VIAL_DMG_BASE}+{C:IceSystem.VIAL_DMG_ATK%}% 攻击力 + {C:IceSystem.VIAL_DMG_MAXHP%}% 目标最大生命值）魔法伤害并施加冰寒 {C:IceSystem.VIAL_CHILL_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Every {C:IceSystem.VIAL_IV} seconds, throws an ice flask that deals ({C:IceSystem.VIAL_DMG_BASE} + {C:IceSystem.VIAL_DMG_ATK%}% Attack + {C:IceSystem.VIAL_DMG_MAXHP%}% of the target's max health) magic damage and applies Chill for {C:IceSystem.VIAL_CHILL_SEC} seconds."

msgid "【法力】充满时获得护盾并推出冰道，冰封命中的敌人 1/1.8/2.5 秒。"
msgstr "[Mana] When full, gains a shield and sends out an ice path that freezes enemies hit for 1/1.8/2.5 seconds."

msgid "【法力】充满时发射贯穿光束。【迷你水晶】达到 {C:CrystalSystem.MINI_STACK_MAX} 层时引爆。"
msgstr "[Mana] When full, fires a piercing beam. [Mini Crystal] Detonates at {C:CrystalSystem.MINI_STACK_MAX} stacks."

msgid "攻击和技能每段命中后，向目标周围溅射 15/28/50% 本段伤害。"
msgstr "Each attack and ability hit splashes 15/28/50% of its damage around the target."

msgid "【法力】充满时进行 {C:CrystalSystem.SWEEP_ARC_DEG}° 水晶射线扫射并偷取魔抗。【迷你水晶】达到 {C:CrystalSystem.MINI_STACK_MAX} 层时引爆。"
msgstr "[Mana] When full, sweeps a crystal ray across {C:CrystalSystem.SWEEP_ARC_DEG}° and steals Magic Resist. [Mini Crystal] Detonates at {C:CrystalSystem.MINI_STACK_MAX} stacks."

msgid "登场时召唤一只亡灵骷髅，其受到的任何攻击均只造成 1 点伤害。"
msgstr "On spawn, summons an undead skeleton that takes only 1 damage from any attack."

msgid "彻底阵亡时在原位变为一只小虫继续战斗，并随机携带 3 件装备。"
msgstr "When it dies for good, becomes a bug in place that keeps fighting, carrying 3 random items."

msgid "每 {C:EquipTickSystem.DOLL_IV} 秒派出小熊撞击最近的敌人。达到 5/3/1 层后召唤一只大熊。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipTickSystem.DOLL_IV} seconds, sends a little bear to ram the nearest enemy. At 5/3/1 stacks, summons a big bear."

msgid "每秒回复 2/5/10+自身最大生命值 0.3/0.8/1.2% 的生命值。孵化进度满 {C:EquipTickSystem.EGG_FULL} 时获得 1 点临时等级，上限 3/4/5 级。"
msgstr "Heals 2/5/10 + 0.3/0.8/1.2% of max health per second. Gains 1 temporary level each time hatching reaches {C:EquipTickSystem.EGG_FULL}, up to 3/4/5 levels."

msgid "蜡烛每 {C:EquipSystem.CANDLE_IV} 秒切换阶段：微弱阶段持续治疗，燃烧阶段爆燃并施加灼烧。"
msgstr "The candle switches phase every {C:EquipSystem.CANDLE_IV} seconds: the Flicker phase heals over time; the Blaze phase flares up and applies Burn."

msgid "攻击叠加放大层数，每层提供 1/2/5% 增伤。每 {C:SignalWaveSystem.EVERY} 层爆发一道弧形电磁波。"
msgstr "Attacks build Amplify stacks, each granting 1/2/5% Damage Amp. Every {C:SignalWaveSystem.EVERY} stacks, releases an arcing electromagnetic wave."

msgid "每 3 次攻击射出竹箭，命中后永久提升最大生命值 50/70/90。"
msgstr "Every 3 attacks, fires a bamboo arrow. On hit, permanently gains 50/70/90 Max Health."

msgid "登场时给予 1/2/3 名敌人各一把古灵精怪枪。之后每 {C:EquipSystem.FPGA_IV} 秒随机抽取 1/2/4 个状态。"
msgstr "On spawn, gives 1/2/3 enemies a Trickster Gun each. Then draws 1/2/4 random statuses every {C:EquipSystem.FPGA_IV} seconds."

msgid "攻击和技能可处决生命值低于最大生命值 4/6/12% 的敌人。每 {C:EquipSystem.FANG_IV} 秒射出一颗毒牙并回复生命值。"
msgstr "Attacks and abilities execute enemies below 4/6/12% of their max health. Every {C:EquipSystem.FANG_IV} seconds, fires a venom fang and heals."

msgid "登场 {C:EquipSystem.TIDE_DELAY} 秒后进入【涨潮】，期间提升最大生命值、攻击力、体型与射程，结束后进入【退潮】。"
msgstr "{C:EquipSystem.TIDE_DELAY} seconds after spawning, enters [High Tide], gaining max health, attack damage, size and range. Enters [Low Tide] when it ends."

msgid "每 {C:EquipSystem.RIPPLE_IV} 秒为全队各回复其已损失生命值的 3/6/10%。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipSystem.RIPPLE_IV} seconds, heals each ally for 3/6/10% of its missing health."

msgid "【法力】充满时掀起横贯全场的浪墙：友军获得护盾与双抗，敌人被击飞并失去双抗。"
msgstr "[Mana] When full, raises a wave wall across the whole field: allies gain a shield, Armor and Magic Resist; enemies are knocked up and lose Armor and Magic Resist."

msgid "生命值首次低于 {C:EquipSystem.LOWHP_GATE%}% 时，{C:EquipSystem.NECKLACE_HOT_SEC} 秒内回复自身最大生命值 40/85/130%。"
msgstr "The first time health drops below {C:EquipSystem.LOWHP_GATE%}%, heals 40/85/130% of max health over {C:EquipSystem.NECKLACE_HOT_SEC} seconds."

msgid "生命值首次低于 {C:EquipSystem.LOWHP_GATE%}% 时回复 30/60/100% 最大生命值，并发射火球点燃敌人。"
msgstr "The first time health drops below {C:EquipSystem.LOWHP_GATE%}%, heals 30/60/100% of max health and launches fireballs that ignite enemies."

msgid "每闪避一次攻击，获得 30/50/120 点护盾，持续 {C:BattleDamage.COMMON_SHIELD_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Each dodged attack grants a 30/50/120 shield for {C:BattleDamage.COMMON_SHIELD_SEC} seconds."

msgid "每 {C:EquipSystem.HANDGUN_IV} 秒射出 4/5/6 发子弹，每发造成 50/90/150% 攻击力物理伤害。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipSystem.HANDGUN_IV} seconds, fires 4/5/6 bullets, each dealing 50/90/150% Attack as physical damage."

msgid "每 {C:EquipSystem.XBOW_IV} 秒朝最远的敌人连射 1/2/3 发，伤害随目标已损失生命值提升。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipSystem.XBOW_IV} seconds, fires 1/2/3 bolts at the farthest enemy. Damage increases with the target's missing health."

msgid "每 {C:EquipSystem.GATLING_IV} 秒打出 20/30/60 发子弹，命中的目标永久失去 1/2/3 护甲。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipSystem.GATLING_IV} seconds, fires 20/30/60 bullets. Targets hit permanently lose 1/2/3 Armor."

msgid "攻击和技能每段命中有 50/75/100% 概率追加一次 70/80/100% 攻击力刺击。"
msgstr "Each attack and ability hit has a 50/75/100% chance to add a stab dealing 70/80/100% Attack."

msgid "每 {C:EquipSystem.PISTOL_IV} 秒打出一道贯穿激光，对首个敌人造成 150/200/280% 攻击力的伤害并施加流血。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipSystem.PISTOL_IV} seconds, fires a piercing laser that deals 150/200/280% Attack to the first enemy and applies Bleed."

msgid "每 {C:EquipSystem.REVOLVER_IV} 秒射出 1 发子弹，造成 150/310/1200 点物理伤害。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipSystem.REVOLVER_IV} seconds, fires 1 bullet that deals 150/310/1200 physical damage."

msgid "每 {C:EquipSystem.SHOTGUN_IV} 秒打出 12/14/18 颗弹珠。被 {C:EquipSystem.SHOTGUN_STUN_HITS} 颗及以上弹珠命中的敌人眩晕 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.CTRL_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipSystem.SHOTGUN_IV} seconds, fires 12/14/18 pellets. Enemies hit by {C:EquipSystem.SHOTGUN_STUN_HITS} or more pellets are stunned for {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.CTRL_SEC} seconds."

msgid "累计造成 {C:HookBombSystem.TRIGGER_DMG} 点伤害后投出钩索炸弹，持续造成伤害，直到目标死亡。"
msgstr "After dealing {C:HookBombSystem.TRIGGER_DMG} total damage, throws a hook bomb that keeps dealing damage until the target dies."

msgid "被击飞的敌人获得靶子标记。每 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.EQ_TICK} 秒向所有带有靶子的敌人各射出一枚飞镖。"
msgstr "Enemies that get knocked up are marked as Targets. Every {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.EQ_TICK} seconds, throws a dart at each marked enemy."

msgid "每 {C:EquipSystem.SNIPER_IV} 秒狙击生命值百分比最低的敌人。若这一枪造成击杀，则重新蓄力再开一枪。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipSystem.SNIPER_IV} seconds, snipes the enemy with the lowest health percentage. If the shot kills, reloads and fires again."

msgid "登场时召唤一座不可移动的炮台，炮台的攻击永久累积暴击率。"
msgstr "On spawn, summons an immobile turret whose attacks permanently build Crit Chance."

msgid "登场第 {C:TimestopSystem.TS_START_T} 秒发动时间停止，全场定格 4/7/20 秒，每个战场各一次。"
msgstr "At {C:TimestopSystem.TS_START_T} seconds after spawning, casts Time Stop, freezing the whole field for 4/7/20 seconds. Once per battle."

msgid "伞收起 {C:EqSpiritBatch.PARASOL_IDLE} 秒后撑开 {C:EqSpiritBatch.PARASOL_OPEN} 秒，期间自身与附近的队友获得 11/22/35% 减伤。"
msgstr "The umbrella opens for {C:EqSpiritBatch.PARASOL_OPEN} seconds after being closed for {C:EqSpiritBatch.PARASOL_IDLE} seconds. While open, it and nearby allies gain 11/22/35% Damage Reduction."

msgid "每 {C:EquipTickSystem.SWORD_STORM_IV} 秒召出一排剑穿过全体敌人，各造成（70/100/400+80/130/400% 攻击力）物理伤害。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipTickSystem.SWORD_STORM_IV} seconds, summons a row of swords that pass through all enemies, each dealing (70/100/400 + 80/130/400% Attack) physical damage."

msgid "攻击额外造成目标 2/2.5/3% 最大生命值的魔法伤害并施加破损，在 {C:EqSpiritBatch.BREACH_CAP} 层时转为真实伤害。"
msgstr "Attacks deal bonus magic damage equal to 2/2.5/3% of the target's max health and apply Fracture. At {C:EqSpiritBatch.BREACH_CAP} stacks, this becomes true damage."

msgid "释放技能后，下次攻击额外造成物理伤害并回复其中 {C:EqSpiritBatch.MANTIS_LEECH%}% 的生命值，伤害随技能消耗的龟能提高。"
msgstr "After casting an ability, the next attack deals bonus physical damage and heals for {C:EqSpiritBatch.MANTIS_LEECH%}% of it. Damage scales with the Energy the ability cost."

msgid "释放技能后获得攻击速度。攻击对敌人施加一层【气环】，可叠加 3 层，满层时引爆，造成基于该敌人最大生命值的真实伤害。"
msgstr "Gains attack speed after casting an ability. Attacks apply a [Bubble Ring] stack to enemies, up to 3. At max stacks it detonates, dealing true damage based on the enemy's max health."

msgid "生命值首次低于 {C:EqSpiritBatch.GHOST_HP_LINE%}% 时获得 50/80/160% 最大生命值的幽灵护盾，破碎时诅咒敌人。"
msgstr "The first time health drops below {C:EqSpiritBatch.GHOST_HP_LINE%}%, gains a Ghost Shield equal to 50/80/160% of max health. When it breaks, it curses enemies."

msgid "每次攻击获得 {C:EqPotionBatch.LIVER_ENERGY} 点龟能与 3/5/7% 攻击速度，可无限叠加。"
msgstr "Each attack grants {C:EqPotionBatch.LIVER_ENERGY} Energy and 3/5/7% attack speed, stacking infinitely."

msgid "登场第 {C:EqPotionBatch.BREW_AT} 秒饮用药水：免疫控制效果直到本战场结束，并提升多项属性。"
msgstr "At {C:EqPotionBatch.BREW_AT} seconds after spawning, drinks the potion: immune to crowd control until the battle ends, and gains several stats."

msgid "每 {C:EquipSystem.VIAL_IV} 秒向敌人最密集处投掷毒瓶，施加 40/70/110 层中毒并施加治疗削减。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipSystem.VIAL_IV} seconds, throws a poison vial at the densest group of enemies, applying 40/70/110 Poison and Grievous Wounds."

msgid "将受到的伤害储存为充能。每 {C:EqPotionBatch.CAN_PERIOD} 秒消耗全部充能，转化为法力护盾并发射激光。"
msgstr "Stores damage taken as charge. Every {C:EqPotionBatch.CAN_PERIOD} seconds, spends all charge to gain a mana shield and fire a laser."

msgid "生命值首次低于 {C:EqFoodBatch.CAKE_LINE_1%}%、{C:EqFoodBatch.CAKE_LINE_2%}%、{C:EqFoodBatch.CAKE_LINE_3%}% 时各吃下一块蛋糕，依次获得最大生命值、攻击力与护盾。"
msgstr "Eats a slice of cake the first time health drops below {C:EqFoodBatch.CAKE_LINE_1%}%, {C:EqFoodBatch.CAKE_LINE_2%}% and {C:EqFoodBatch.CAKE_LINE_3%}%, gaining max health, attack damage and a shield in turn."

msgid "攻击附带自身 3/4.5/7% 最大生命值的伤害并溅射。受到的伤害存入灰色血条并转化为生命回复。"
msgstr "Attacks deal bonus damage equal to 3/4.5/7% of own max health and splash. Damage taken is stored in a gray health bar and turned into healing."

msgid "每 {C:EquipTickSystem.BROADSWORD_IV} 秒挥出一道贯穿直线的剑气墙，并获得总伤害 50/75/100% 的护盾。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipTickSystem.BROADSWORD_IV} seconds, swings out a piercing wall of sword energy and gains a shield equal to 50/75/100% of the total damage."

msgid "每个战场开始时为全队提供各自最大生命值 10/18/25% 的奶油护盾，护盾破碎时对周围敌人造成伤害。"
msgstr "At the start of each battle, gives each ally a Cream Shield equal to 10/18/25% of its max health. When broken, it damages nearby enemies."

msgid "获得自身最大生命值 50/80/120% 的终极护盾，护盾存在期间化身蛋糕礼盒并嘲讽敌人。"
msgstr "Gains an Ultimate Shield equal to 50/80/120% of max health. While it holds, becomes a Cake Box and taunts enemies."

msgid "每次攻击时，藤蔓小球射出一支藤蔓箭。藤蔓箭暴击时转为真实伤害并提升攻击速度。"
msgstr "Each attack, a vine orb fires a vine arrow. Critical vine arrows deal true damage and grant attack speed."

msgid "每次攻击获得可无限叠加的护盾，并附带魔法伤害。"
msgstr "Each attack grants an infinitely stacking shield and deals bonus magic damage."

msgid "每 {C:EqBowBatch.RAIN_IV} 秒在敌人最密集处降下一轮箭雨。目标每远离 {C:EqBowBatch.AMP_PER_PX} 码，攻击、技能与箭雨对其造成的伤害提升 3/4/5%。"
msgstr "Every {C:EqBowBatch.RAIN_IV} seconds, rains arrows on the densest group of enemies. For every {C:EqBowBatch.AMP_PER_PX} units of distance, attacks, abilities and arrow rain deal 3/4/5% more damage to the target."

msgid "释放技能后连续射出竹箭贯穿敌人，每穿过一个敌人偷取 0.5/0.5/1 点龟能。"
msgstr "After casting an ability, fires a burst of bamboo arrows that pierce enemies, stealing 0.5/0.5/1 Energy per enemy pierced."

msgid "生成一把迷你手枪协同攻击，其受到的所有伤害降为 2 点。"
msgstr "Creates a mini pistol that attacks alongside. All damage it takes is reduced to 2."

msgid "附近有敌人时，每 {C:EqGunBatch.EEL_IV} 秒左右两管交替开火：左管发射锥形霰弹，右管发射可连锁全场的电击弹。"
msgstr "With enemies nearby, the two barrels fire in turn every {C:EqGunBatch.EEL_IV} seconds: the left fires a cone of buckshot, the right fires a shock round that can chain across the field."

msgid "在身后生成一座医疗炮台，攻击对敌人造成伤害，并为生命百分比最低的友军回复生命值。"
msgstr "Creates a medic turret behind it. Its attacks damage enemies and heal the ally with the lowest health percentage."

msgid "登场时召唤一架直升机进行扫射。直升机龟能满时沿航线发动地毯轰炸。"
msgstr "On spawn, summons a gyrocopter that strafes enemies. At full Energy, it carpet-bombs along its route."

msgid "每 {C:EquipTickSystem.CORAL_IV} 秒向最远的敌人射出珊瑚刺，造成 100/120/150% 攻击力物理伤害，外加 8/12/18% 目标最大生命值的魔法伤害。"
msgstr "Every {C:EquipTickSystem.CORAL_IV} seconds, fires a coral spike at the farthest enemy, dealing 100/120/150% Attack as physical damage plus 8/12/18% of the target's max health as magic damage."

msgid "每受到自身最大生命值 40/35/30% 的伤害，举盾 2.5/3/3.5 秒，期间获得护盾与双抗。"
msgstr "For every 40/35/30% of max health taken as damage, raises its shield for 2.5/3/3.5 seconds, gaining a shield, Armor and Magic Resist."

msgid "每受到一段攻击反伤 3/5/8 点。每反伤 {C:EqBladeBatch.CLAM_PER_CHARGE} 次获得一层充能，攻击消耗充能并回复生命值。"
msgstr "Reflects 3/5/8 damage per hit taken. Every {C:EqBladeBatch.CLAM_PER_CHARGE} reflects grants a charge; attacks spend charges to heal."

msgid "每损失 1% 生命值获得 0.2/0.3/0.4% 攻击速度。连续命中同一目标时叠加增伤。"
msgstr "Gains 0.2/0.3/0.4% attack speed for every 1% health lost. Hitting the same target repeatedly builds Damage Amp."

msgid "近战携带：技能替换为十字斩，射程变为 {C:EqBladeBatch.HH_MELEE_RANGE}，并获得增伤。远程携带：射程转化为生命值、攻击力与生命偷取，并获得减伤。"
msgstr "Melee holder: ability becomes Cross Slash, range becomes {C:EqBladeBatch.HH_MELEE_RANGE}, and gains Damage Amp. Ranged holder: range converts into health, attack damage and Lifesteal, and gains Damage Reduction."

msgid "将受到伤害的 5/9/15% 转化为龟能，每秒上限 20/40/60 点。"
msgstr "Converts 5/9/15% of damage taken into Energy, up to 20/40/60 per second."

msgid "每 {C:EqGadgetBatch.SEXT_GEN_IV} 秒生成一个浮游炮（最多 {C:EqGadgetBatch.SEXT_CAP} 个），累计攻击次数达到后齐射终极射线。"
msgstr "Every {C:EqGadgetBatch.SEXT_GEN_IV} seconds, creates a drone cannon (up to {C:EqGadgetBatch.SEXT_CAP}). After enough attacks, they fire an ultimate ray together."

msgid "每 15/10/4 秒偷取并释放一个训龟大师的技能。受到的伤害先存入压载舱。"
msgstr "Every 15/10/4 seconds, steals and casts one of the Turtle Trainer's abilities. Damage taken is stored in the ballast tank first."

msgid "【法力】充满时立起潮汐碑，持续 {C:EqArcaneBatch.STELE_SEC} 秒：碑内敌人持续受到伤害，友军获得护盾与攻击速度。"
msgstr "[Mana] When full, raises a Tide Stele for {C:EqArcaneBatch.STELE_SEC} seconds: enemies inside take damage over time; allies gain a shield and attack speed."

msgid "【法力】充满时对最近的敌人贴上【符纸】：{C:EqArcaneBatch.TALISMAN_SEC} 秒内造成 400/700/1000 魔法伤害并降低魔抗。"
msgstr "[Mana] When full, sticks a [Talisman] on the nearest enemy, dealing 400/700/1000 magic damage over {C:EqArcaneBatch.TALISMAN_SEC} seconds and lowering its Magic Resist."

msgid "【法力】充满时跃起猛砸地面，造成伤害并眩晕 2/3/8 秒。"
msgstr "[Mana] When full, leaps up and slams the ground, dealing damage and stunning for 2/3/8 seconds."

msgid "攻击和技能命中时积累充能，达到 {C:EquipSystem.BLADE_FULL} 点时朝敌群斩出一道弧形刀光。只命中 1 名敌人时伤害提高 100/150/200%。"
msgstr "Attack and ability hits build charge. At {C:EquipSystem.BLADE_FULL}, slashes an arc of light at the enemy group. Deals 100/150/200% more damage if it hits only 1 enemy."

msgid "每 {C:EqRelicBatch.SCUTE_IV} 秒回复 1/2/3 点+自身最大生命值 0.1/0.15/0.2% 的生命值，生命值低于 {C:EqRelicBatch.SCUTE_LOW_GATE%}% 时回复效果提升至 {C:EqRelicBatch.SCUTE_LOW_MULT} 倍。"
msgstr "Every {C:EqRelicBatch.SCUTE_IV} seconds, heals 1/2/3 + 0.1/0.15/0.2% of max health. Below {C:EqRelicBatch.SCUTE_LOW_GATE%}% health, healing is multiplied by {C:EqRelicBatch.SCUTE_LOW_MULT}."

msgid "召唤一只剧毒飞行物，沿途留下毒雾，对敌人叠加中毒与缓速。"
msgstr "Summons a venomous flyer that leaves a poison fog along its path, stacking Poison and Slow on enemies."

msgid "每 {C:IncenseStoneSystem.EMP_IV} 秒强化接下来的 {C:IncenseStoneSystem.EMP_SHOTS} 次攻击：+{C:IncenseStoneSystem.EMP_ASPD%}% 攻击速度，并附带额外伤害，回复该伤害 {C:IncenseStoneSystem.EMP_LS%}% 的生命值。"
msgstr "Every {C:IncenseStoneSystem.EMP_IV} seconds, empowers the next {C:IncenseStoneSystem.EMP_SHOTS} attacks: +{C:IncenseStoneSystem.EMP_ASPD%}% attack speed and bonus damage, healing for {C:IncenseStoneSystem.EMP_LS%}% of that damage."

msgid "阵亡时立起祖龟碑：全队获得 12/22/35% 增伤，并每 {C:EqRelicBatch.STELE_BOLT_IV} 秒砸下石雷。"
msgstr "On death, raises an Ancestor Turtle Stele: the team gains 12/22/35% Damage Amp, and it drops a stone bolt every {C:EqRelicBatch.STELE_BOLT_IV} seconds."

msgid "每 {C:ShieldSynergySystem.HOLY_PERIOD} 秒获得 {C:ShieldSynergySystem.HOLY_AMOUNT} 点圣光护盾。护盾存在时，每次被攻击或技能命中时反击 {C:ShieldSynergySystem.RIPOSTE_FLAT} 点真实伤害。"
msgstr "Gains {C:ShieldSynergySystem.HOLY_AMOUNT} Holy Shield every {C:ShieldSynergySystem.HOLY_PERIOD} seconds. While it holds, each attack or ability hit taken strikes back for {C:ShieldSynergySystem.RIPOSTE_FLAT} true damage."

msgid "登场时召唤【斧头】，【斧头】会定期回复生命值并获得护盾，攻击会窃取目标的护盾。小木斧会随【砍伐经验】进化。"
msgstr "On spawn, summons [Axe]. [Axe] periodically heals and gains a shield, and its attacks steal the target's shield. The Little Wooden Axe evolves with [Chopping XP]."

msgid "每隔一个攻击间隔朝最近的敌人斩出扇形激光。仅命中 1 名敌人时追加一道直线斩击。"
msgstr "Every attack interval, slashes a fan of laser at the nearest enemy. If it hits only 1 enemy, adds a straight slash."

msgid "每秒受到魔法伤害：每层 1 点 + 自身最大生命值的 {C:CombatMath.STACK_DOT_MAXHP_PCT%}%。每秒造成伤害后层数变为 {C:CombatMath.STACK_DECAY%}%（向下取整），降到 0 层时消失。"
msgstr "Takes magic damage each second: 1 per stack + {C:CombatMath.STACK_DOT_MAXHP_PCT%}% of own max health. After each tick, stacks drop to {C:CombatMath.STACK_DECAY%}% (rounded down) and the effect ends at 0."

msgid "按闪避率完全躲开一次攻击或技能，闪避率上限 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.DODGE_CAP%}%。持续伤害与必中攻击无法闪避。"
msgstr "Completely avoids an attack or ability based on Dodge chance, capped at {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.DODGE_CAP%}%. Damage over time and sure-hit attacks can't be dodged."

msgid "攻击和技能造成的物理伤害降低 {C:GhostSystem.PHASE_PHYS_CUT%}%。流血、魔法伤害和真实伤害不受影响。"
msgstr "Physical damage from attacks and abilities is reduced by {C:GhostSystem.PHASE_PHYS_CUT%}%. Bleed, magic damage and true damage are unaffected."

msgid "无法被敌方攻击和指向型技能选为目标，范围伤害仍可命中。"
msgstr "Can't be targeted by enemy attacks or targeted abilities. Area damage still hits."

msgid "受到伤害时，按反伤比例对攻击者造成等量的真实伤害。比例见下方来源。"
msgstr "When taking damage, deals true damage to the attacker based on the Thorns ratio. See sources below for ratios."

msgid "赛博龟的充能层：登场 {C:CyberSystem.AI_START_CHARGE} 层，每次释放技能 +1 层。敌人贴近时消耗 1 层自动冲刺躲避。"
msgstr "Cyber Turtle's charges: starts with {C:CyberSystem.AI_START_CHARGE}, +1 per ability cast. When an enemy gets close, spends 1 to dash away automatically."

msgid "降低移动速度、攻击速度、龟能充能速度中的一项或多项，降幅见下方来源。"
msgstr "Reduces one or more of move speed, attack speed and Energy charge rate. See sources below for amounts."

msgid "移动速度降低，降幅见下方来源。多个减速不叠加。"
msgstr "Move speed is reduced. See sources below for amounts. Multiple slows don't stack."

msgid "受到的治疗降低，降幅见下方来源。多个来源不叠加，取最高值。"
msgstr "Healing received is reduced. See sources below for amounts. Multiple sources don't stack; the highest applies."

msgid "龟能不增长，解除后继续充能。"
msgstr "Energy doesn't increase. Charging resumes when it ends."

msgid "持续 {C:EquipSystem.EMBER_TRUEFIRE_SEC} 秒：受到的灼烧伤害转为真实伤害。"
msgstr "For {C:EquipSystem.EMBER_TRUEFIRE_SEC} seconds: Burn damage taken becomes true damage."

msgid "每秒受到魔法伤害：每层 1 点。每秒造成伤害后层数变为 {C:CombatMath.STACK_DECAY%}%（向下取整），降到 0 层时消失。"
msgstr "Takes magic damage each second: 1 per stack. After each tick, stacks drop to {C:CombatMath.STACK_DECAY%}% (rounded down) and the effect ends at 0."

msgid "每层使受到的伤害 +{C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_PER_STACK%}%（按弓箭羁绊档位），上限 {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_MAX} 层。满层时受到的伤害中 {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_TRUE_PCT%}% 转为真实伤害。"
msgstr "Each stack increases damage taken by {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_PER_STACK%}% (by Bow synergy tier), up to {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_MAX} stacks. At max stacks, {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_TRUE_PCT%}% of damage taken becomes true damage."

msgid "每层使每次受到的伤害额外附带 {C:LineSystem.INK_TRUE_PER_STACK%}% 的真实伤害，这部分无视减伤与护盾。上限 {C:LineSystem.INK_CAP} 层（墨水炸弹：{C:LineSystem.INK_CAP_BOMB} 层）。"
msgstr "Each stack adds {C:LineSystem.INK_TRUE_PER_STACK%}% of every hit taken as true damage, ignoring Damage Reduction and shields. Up to {C:LineSystem.INK_CAP} stacks ({C:LineSystem.INK_CAP_BOMB} with Ink Bomb)."

msgid "叠满 {C:CrystalSystem.STACK_MAX} 层时引爆：受到自身最大生命值 {C:CrystalSystem.BURST_MAXHP_PCT%}% 的魔法伤害，魔抗降低 {C:CrystalSystem.BURST_MR_SHRED%}%，持续 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} 秒，层数清零。"
msgstr "Detonates at {C:CrystalSystem.STACK_MAX} stacks: takes magic damage equal to {C:CrystalSystem.BURST_MAXHP_PCT%}% of own max health and loses {C:CrystalSystem.BURST_MR_SHRED%}% Magic Resist for {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} seconds. Stacks reset."

msgid "叠满 {C:LightningSystem.SHOCK_STACK_MAX} 层时引爆：受到闪电龟 {C:LightningSystem.SHOCK_COEF%}% 攻击力的真实伤害，层数清零。"
msgstr "Detonates at {C:LightningSystem.SHOCK_STACK_MAX} stacks: takes true damage equal to {C:LightningSystem.SHOCK_COEF%}% of Lightning Turtle's Attack. Stacks reset."

msgid "持续 {C:HunterSystem.MARK_SEC} 秒：斩杀线从 {C:HunterSystem.EXEC_BASE%}% 提高到 {C:HunterSystem.EXEC_MARKED%}%。"
msgstr "For {C:HunterSystem.MARK_SEC} seconds: the execute threshold rises from {C:HunterSystem.EXEC_BASE%}% to {C:HunterSystem.EXEC_MARKED%}%."

msgid "每秒受到物理伤害：每层 1 点。每秒造成伤害后层数变为 {C:CombatMath.STACK_DECAY%}%（向下取整），降到 0 层时消失。"
msgstr "Takes physical damage each second: 1 per stack. After each tick, stacks drop to {C:CombatMath.STACK_DECAY%}% (rounded down) and the effect ends at 0."

msgid "每秒受到自身最大生命值 {C:BattleDamage.CURSE_HP_PCT%}% 的真实伤害。重复施加只延长持续时间，不叠加伤害。"
msgstr "Takes true damage equal to {C:BattleDamage.CURSE_HP_PCT%}% of own max health each second. Reapplying only extends the duration; damage doesn't stack."

msgid "无法移动、攻击和释放技能，期间龟能不增长。"
msgstr "Can't move, attack or cast abilities, and Energy doesn't increase."

msgid "被击飞到空中：无法移动、攻击和释放技能，期间龟能不增长，落地后恢复。"
msgstr "Knocked into the air: can't move, attack or cast abilities, and Energy doesn't increase until landing."

msgid "无头龟的恐吓施加的眩晕，效果与眩晕相同：无法移动、攻击和释放技能，期间龟能不增长。蛋类单位免疫。"
msgstr "A stun from Headless Turtle's Intimidate, same as Stun: can't move, attack or cast abilities, and Energy doesn't increase. Egg units are immune."

msgid "只能攻击施加嘲讽的单位。"
msgstr "Can only attack the unit that applied the Taunt."

msgid "先于生命值承受伤害，可吸收所有类型的伤害，包括真实伤害。"
msgstr "Absorbs damage before health. Blocks all damage types, including true damage."

msgid "只吸收魔法伤害，先于护盾承受。物理伤害与真实伤害不受影响。不随时间消失。"
msgstr "Absorbs only magic damage, before regular shields. Physical and true damage are unaffected. Doesn't decay over time."

msgid "好友数量已达上限 100 人"
msgstr "Friend list full (100)"

msgid "海盗龟登场时轰击 1 名随机敌人，造成其 {C:PirateSystem.PLUNDER_MAXHP_PCT%}% 最大生命值的真实伤害。\n海盗龟阵亡时甩出钩索抓住击杀它的单位，将其拉到身旁并眩晕 {C:PirateSystem.HOOK_STUN} 秒，造成其 {C:PirateSystem.PLUNDER_MAXHP_PCT%}% 最大生命值的真实伤害。"
msgstr "On spawn, Pirate Turtle bombards 1 random enemy for true damage equal to {C:PirateSystem.PLUNDER_MAXHP_PCT%}% of its max health.\nOn death, Pirate Turtle hooks its killer, pulling it close, stunning it for {C:PirateSystem.HOOK_STUN} seconds and dealing true damage equal to {C:PirateSystem.PLUNDER_MAXHP_PCT%}% of its max health."

msgid "糖果龟在战斗第 {C:CandySystem.DRAIN_AT} 秒吸取最大生命值最高的敌人 {C:CandySystem.DRAIN_MAXHP_PCT%}% 最大生命值，并回复等量生命值。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">该吸取不会杀死目标。</span>"
msgstr "At {C:CandySystem.DRAIN_AT} seconds into battle, Candy Turtle drains {C:CandySystem.DRAIN_MAXHP_PCT%}% max health from the enemy with the highest max health and heals for the same amount.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">This drain can't kill.</span>"

msgid "泡泡龟将受到伤害的 {C:BubbleSystem.FOAM_STORE_PCT%}% 储存为泡泡值，上限为自身最大生命值。\n每 {C:BubbleSystem.FOAM_IV} 秒，泡泡龟消耗 {C:BubbleSystem.FOAM_DMG_PCT%}% 泡泡值对最近的敌人造成等量魔法伤害，并消耗 {C:BubbleSystem.FOAM_HEAL_PCT%}% 泡泡值回复等量生命值。"
msgstr "Bubble Turtle stores {C:BubbleSystem.FOAM_STORE_PCT%}% of damage taken as Bubbles, up to its max health.\nEvery {C:BubbleSystem.FOAM_IV} seconds, it spends {C:BubbleSystem.FOAM_DMG_PCT%}% of its Bubbles to deal that much magic damage to the nearest enemy, and spends {C:BubbleSystem.FOAM_HEAL_PCT%}% to heal for that much."

msgid "泡泡龟用泡泡束缚目标，使其眩晕 {C:BubbleSystem.BIND_SEC} 秒。期间目标每受到一段伤害，护甲与魔抗各永久减少 {C:BubbleSystem.BIND_SHRED_LOW} 点（泡泡龟 {C:BubbleSystem.BIND_LV_GATE} 级以上时为 {C:BubbleSystem.BIND_SHRED_HIGH} 点）。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">每次束缚最多各减少 {C:BubbleSystem.BIND_SHRED_CAP} 点。</span>"
msgstr "Bubble Turtle binds the target in a bubble, stunning it for {C:BubbleSystem.BIND_SEC} seconds. Each hit it takes meanwhile permanently removes {C:BubbleSystem.BIND_SHRED_LOW} Armor and Magic Resist ({C:BubbleSystem.BIND_SHRED_HIGH} at level {C:BubbleSystem.BIND_LV_GATE}+).\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Up to {C:BubbleSystem.BIND_SHRED_CAP} of each per bind.</span>"

msgid "线条龟的攻击与技能会为目标叠加墨迹。\n目标每受到一次伤害，每层墨迹使其额外受到相当于该伤害 {C:LineSystem.INK_TRUE_PER_STACK%}% 的真实伤害。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">墨迹上限为 {C:LineSystem.INK_CAP} 层，选择【墨水炸弹】时提升至 {C:LineSystem.INK_CAP_BOMB} 层，满层时为 {C:LineSystem.INK_TRUE_FULL_BOMB%}%。</span>\n线条龟获得（{C:LineSystem.ASPD_PER_ATK%}%×攻击力({ATK}) = {E:ATK*LineSystem.ASPD_PER_ATK*100}%）攻击速度。"
msgstr "Line Turtle's attacks and abilities apply Ink to targets.\nEach time the target takes damage, every Ink stack adds true damage equal to {C:LineSystem.INK_TRUE_PER_STACK%}% of that damage.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Ink caps at {C:LineSystem.INK_CAP} stacks, or {C:LineSystem.INK_CAP_BOMB} with [Ink Bomb] ({C:LineSystem.INK_TRUE_FULL_BOMB%}% at max).</span>\nLine Turtle gains ({C:LineSystem.ASPD_PER_ATK%}% × Attack ({ATK}) = {E:ATK*LineSystem.ASPD_PER_ATK*100}%) attack speed."

msgid "火山形态：火山龟获得 {C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_HP_PCT%}% 自身最大生命值、{C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_HASTE%}% 攻击速度与 {C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_SPD%}% 移动速度，持续 {C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Volcano Form: gains {C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_HP_PCT%}% of max health, {C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_HASTE%}% attack speed and {C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_SPD%}% move speed for {C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_SEC} seconds."

msgid "无头龟获得 {C:HeadlessSystem.UNDEAD_LIFESTEAL%}% 生命偷取。\n无头龟每损失 1% 生命值，便获得 {C:HeadlessSystem.UNDEAD_ATK_PER_LOST}% 攻击力，至多 {C:HeadlessSystem.UNDEAD_ATK_PER_LOST%}%。\n无头龟首次受到致命伤害时进入亡灵状态，{C:HeadlessSystem.UNDEAD_DEATHFLOOR} 秒内生命值不会低于 1。"
msgstr "Headless Turtle gains {C:HeadlessSystem.UNDEAD_LIFESTEAL%}% Lifesteal.\nFor every 1% health lost, it gains {C:HeadlessSystem.UNDEAD_ATK_PER_LOST}% attack damage, up to {C:HeadlessSystem.UNDEAD_ATK_PER_LOST%}%.\nThe first time it takes lethal damage, it becomes Undead and can't drop below 1 health for {C:HeadlessSystem.UNDEAD_DEATHFLOOR} seconds."

msgid "被动：天使龟的攻击每次命中获得 {C:AngelSystem.ASCEND_ENERGY_PER_HIT} 龟能与 {C:AngelSystem.ASCEND_ATK_PER_HIT%}% 攻击力，持续到本战场结束。\n\n主动：天使龟获得 {C:AngelSystem.ASCEND_ASPD%}% 攻击速度、{C:AngelSystem.ASCEND_MOVE%}% 移动速度和 {C:AngelSystem.ASCEND_RANGE} 码射程，持续到本战场结束，可无限叠加。"
msgstr "Passive: each of Angel Turtle's attack hits grants {C:AngelSystem.ASCEND_ENERGY_PER_HIT} Energy and {C:AngelSystem.ASCEND_ATK_PER_HIT%}% attack damage until the battle ends.\n\nActive: Angel Turtle gains {C:AngelSystem.ASCEND_ASPD%}% attack speed, {C:AngelSystem.ASCEND_MOVE%}% move speed and {C:AngelSystem.ASCEND_RANGE} range until the battle ends, stacking infinitely."

msgid "寒冰龟登场时使全场敌人的攻击速度、龟能充能速度和移动速度降低 {C:IceSystem.AURA_SLOW%}%，持续 {C:IceSystem.AURA_SEC} 秒。\n寒冰龟的攻击和技能对熔岩龟和凤凰龟造成的伤害提升 {C:IceSystem.AURA_VS_FIRE%}%，并免疫灼烧。"
msgstr "On spawn, Ice Turtle reduces all enemies' attack speed, Energy charge rate and move speed by {C:IceSystem.AURA_SLOW%}% for {C:IceSystem.AURA_SEC} seconds.\nIce Turtle's attacks and abilities deal {C:IceSystem.AURA_VS_FIRE%}% more damage to Lava Turtle and Phoenix Turtle, and it is immune to Burn."

msgid "幽灵龟登场时对全体敌人施加 {C:GhostSystem.SPAWN_CURSE_SEC} 秒诅咒，阵亡时对随机 1 名敌人施加 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} 秒诅咒。\n诅咒每秒造成 {C:BattleDamage.CURSE_HP_PCT%}% 目标最大生命值的真实伤害。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">重复施加诅咒时累加持续时间。</span>"
msgstr "On spawn, Ghost Turtle curses all enemies for {C:GhostSystem.SPAWN_CURSE_SEC} seconds. On death, it curses 1 random enemy for {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} seconds.\nCurse deals true damage equal to {C:BattleDamage.CURSE_HP_PCT%}% of the target's max health each second.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Reapplying Curse adds to its duration.</span>"

msgid "钻石龟登场时使包括自身在内的全队护甲和魔抗提升 {C:DiamondSystem.STRUCT_RESIST_UP%}%，钻石龟自身获得 {C:DiamondSystem.STRUCT_FLAT_DR%}% 减伤。"
msgstr "On spawn, Diamond Turtle increases the whole team's (including its own) Armor and Magic Resist by {C:DiamondSystem.STRUCT_RESIST_UP%}%, and gains {C:DiamondSystem.STRUCT_FLAT_DR%}% Damage Reduction itself."

msgid "钻石龟蜷成钻石球滚向最近的敌人，撞击时对附近的敌人造成物理伤害，将其击飞并眩晕 {C:DiamondSystem.ROLL_STUN_MIN}~{C:DiamondSystem.ROLL_STUN_MAX} 秒。\n伤害与眩晕时长随滚动时间提升，{C:DiamondSystem.ROLL_ACCEL_SEC} 秒后达到最大：伤害从 {C:DiamondSystem.ROLL_RESIST_MIN%}% 护甲 + {C:DiamondSystem.ROLL_RESIST_MIN%}% 魔抗 + {C:DiamondSystem.ROLL_MAXHP_MIN%}% 目标最大生命值，提升至 {C:DiamondSystem.ROLL_RESIST_MAX%}% 护甲 + {C:DiamondSystem.ROLL_RESIST_MAX%}% 魔抗 + {C:DiamondSystem.ROLL_MAXHP_MAX%}% 目标最大生命值。\n滚动期间不受眩晕与恐惧影响。\n附近没有敌人时，钻石龟自动开始滚动，不消耗龟能。"
msgstr "Diamond Turtle curls into a diamond ball and rolls at the nearest enemy. On impact, it deals physical damage to nearby enemies, knocking them up and stunning them for {C:DiamondSystem.ROLL_STUN_MIN}–{C:DiamondSystem.ROLL_STUN_MAX} seconds.\nDamage and stun duration grow the longer it rolls, peaking after {C:DiamondSystem.ROLL_ACCEL_SEC} seconds: damage rises from {C:DiamondSystem.ROLL_RESIST_MIN%}% Armor + {C:DiamondSystem.ROLL_RESIST_MIN%}% Magic Resist + {C:DiamondSystem.ROLL_MAXHP_MIN%}% of the target's max health to {C:DiamondSystem.ROLL_RESIST_MAX%}% Armor + {C:DiamondSystem.ROLL_RESIST_MAX%}% Magic Resist + {C:DiamondSystem.ROLL_MAXHP_MAX%}% of the target's max health.\nImmune to Stun and Fear while rolling.\nWith no enemies nearby, Diamond Turtle starts rolling on its own at no Energy cost."

msgid "财神龟每 {C:FortuneSystem.COIN_IV} 秒获得 {C:FortuneSystem.COIN_MIN}~{C:FortuneSystem.COIN_MAX} 枚金币，场上任意单位阵亡时额外获得 {C:FortuneSystem.COIN_ON_DEATH} 枚。金币越多，财神龟的攻击伤害越高。\n财神龟首次生命值降至 {C:FortuneSystem.LOWHP_PCT%}% 以下时，立即获得 {C:FortuneSystem.LOWHP_ENERGY} 点龟能。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">金币只在本战场内有效。</span>"
msgstr "Fortune Turtle gains {C:FortuneSystem.COIN_MIN}–{C:FortuneSystem.COIN_MAX} Gold every {C:FortuneSystem.COIN_IV} seconds, plus {C:FortuneSystem.COIN_ON_DEATH} whenever any unit dies. The more Gold, the harder its attacks hit.\nThe first time its health drops below {C:FortuneSystem.LOWHP_PCT%}%, it instantly gains {C:FortuneSystem.LOWHP_ENERGY} Energy.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Gold only lasts for the current battle.</span>"

msgid "小龟对敌人造成的所有伤害按目标的稀有度提升：C +{C:BasicConsts.RARITY_AMP_C%}% 至 SSS +{C:BasicConsts.RARITY_AMP_SSS%}%。\n每 {C:BasicConsts.SHIELD_CD} 秒，小龟的下一次攻击额外造成 {N:BasicConsts.SHIELD_ATK_COEF*ATK} 外加 {C:BasicConsts.SHIELD_LOST_PCT%}% 目标已损失生命值的物理伤害，将目标击飞，并获得相当于该伤害 {C:BasicConsts.SHIELD_GAIN_PCT%}% 的护盾。"
msgstr "Little Turtle deals more damage to enemies based on their rarity: C +{C:BasicConsts.RARITY_AMP_C%}% up to SSS +{C:BasicConsts.RARITY_AMP_SSS%}%.\nEvery {C:BasicConsts.SHIELD_CD} seconds, its next attack deals {N:BasicConsts.SHIELD_ATK_COEF*ATK} + {C:BasicConsts.SHIELD_LOST_PCT%}% of the target's missing health as bonus physical damage, knocks the target up, and grants a shield equal to {C:BasicConsts.SHIELD_GAIN_PCT%}% of that damage."

msgid "小龟攻击当前目标，造成 {N:BasicConsts.ATTACK_ATK_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害。"
msgstr "Little Turtle attacks the current target, dealing {N:BasicConsts.ATTACK_ATK_COEF*ATK} physical damage."

msgid "小龟在 {C:BasicConsts.STRIKE_ROOT_SEC} 秒内连续发射 {C:BasicConsts.STRIKE_WAVES} 道气波，每道朝随机一名敌人飞出，对命中的第一个敌人造成 {N:BasicConsts.STRIKE_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害。施法期间小龟无法移动和攻击。"
msgstr "Little Turtle fires {C:BasicConsts.STRIKE_WAVES} waves over {C:BasicConsts.STRIKE_ROOT_SEC} seconds, each flying at a random enemy and dealing {N:BasicConsts.STRIKE_COEF*ATK} physical damage to the first enemy hit. It can't move or attack while casting."

msgid "小龟打出一道贯穿气波，对沿途所有敌人造成 {N:BasicConsts.CHI_ATK_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害并将其击飞 {C:BasicConsts.CHI_KNOCK_SEC} 秒。\n施法期间小龟获得 {C:BasicConsts.CHI_CRIT%}% 暴击率、{C:BasicConsts.CHI_LIFESTEAL%}% 生命偷取和 {E:BasicConsts.CHI_ARMOR_PEN_COEF*ATK} 护甲穿透，持续 {C:BasicConsts.CHI_BUFF_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Little Turtle fires a piercing wave that deals {N:BasicConsts.CHI_ATK_COEF*ATK} physical damage to all enemies in its path and knocks them up for {C:BasicConsts.CHI_KNOCK_SEC} seconds.\nWhile casting, it gains {C:BasicConsts.CHI_CRIT%}% Crit Chance, {C:BasicConsts.CHI_LIFESTEAL%}% Lifesteal and {E:BasicConsts.CHI_ARMOR_PEN_COEF*ATK} Armor Pen for {C:BasicConsts.CHI_BUFF_SEC} seconds."

msgid "小龟冲上前抱起目标摔至身后，眩晕 {C:BasicConsts.SLAM_STUN_SEC} 秒，对其造成 {N:BasicConsts.SLAM_MAIN_ATK*ATK} 外加 {E:ATK*BasicConsts.SLAM_MAIN_HP_PER_ATK*100}% 目标最大生命值的物理伤害，并对落点周围其他敌人造成 {N:BasicConsts.SLAM_SPLASH_ATK*ATK} 外加 {E:ATK*BasicConsts.SLAM_SPLASH_HP_PER_ATK*100}% 主目标最大生命值的物理伤害。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">龟蛋以及免疫控制或击飞的目标不会被抱起，只在原地受到伤害。龟蛋免疫此控制。</span>"
msgstr "Little Turtle charges in, grabs the target and slams it down behind, stunning it for {C:BasicConsts.SLAM_STUN_SEC} seconds and dealing {N:BasicConsts.SLAM_MAIN_ATK*ATK} + {E:ATK*BasicConsts.SLAM_MAIN_HP_PER_ATK*100}% of its max health as physical damage. Other enemies near the landing spot take {N:BasicConsts.SLAM_SPLASH_ATK*ATK} + {E:ATK*BasicConsts.SLAM_SPLASH_HP_PER_ATK*100}% of the main target's max health as physical damage.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Turtle Eggs and targets immune to crowd control or knock-ups aren't lifted; they just take the damage in place. Turtle Eggs are immune to this control.</span>"

msgid "骰子龟根据已损失的生命值获得额外暴击率，自身损失 {C:DiceSystem.BLOOD_LOST_GATE%}% 生命值时达到最大值 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.DICE_BLOOD_CRIT%}% 暴击率。"
msgstr "Dice Turtle gains bonus Crit Chance based on missing health, up to {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.DICE_BLOOD_CRIT%}% at {C:DiceSystem.BLOOD_LOST_GATE%}% health lost."

msgid "骰子龟攻击目标，造成 {N:DiceSystem.BASIC_ATK_COEF*ATK+crit*DiceSystem.BASIC_CRIT_FLAT} 物理伤害。"
msgstr "Dice Turtle attacks the target, dealing {N:DiceSystem.BASIC_ATK_COEF*ATK+crit*DiceSystem.BASIC_CRIT_FLAT} physical damage."

msgid "骰子龟朝最近的敌人劈砍，对前方 {C:DiceSystem.ALLIN_ARC_DEG}° 扇形内的敌人造成 {N:DiceSystem.ALLIN_DMG*ATK} 物理伤害，并附带 {C:DiceSystem.ALLIN_LIFESTEAL%}% 生命偷取。"
msgstr "Dice Turtle slashes at the nearest enemy, dealing {N:DiceSystem.ALLIN_DMG*ATK} physical damage to enemies in a {C:DiceSystem.ALLIN_ARC_DEG}° cone in front, with {C:DiceSystem.ALLIN_LIFESTEAL%}% Lifesteal."

msgid "骰子龟掷出命运骰子，获得随机 {C:DiceSystem.FATE_CRIT_MIN%}%~{C:DiceSystem.FATE_CRIT_MAX%}% 暴击率提升，持续到下次释放本技能。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">再次释放会撤销旧增益并重新掷骰。\n</span>\n释放后的首次攻击额外附带 {C:DiceSystem.FATE_LIFESTEAL%}% 生命偷取。"
msgstr "Dice Turtle rolls the Dice of Fate, gaining a random {C:DiceSystem.FATE_CRIT_MIN%}%–{C:DiceSystem.FATE_CRIT_MAX%}% Crit Chance until it casts this again.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Recasting removes the old bonus and rolls again.\n</span>\nThe first attack after casting has {C:DiceSystem.FATE_LIFESTEAL%}% bonus Lifesteal."

msgid "被动：骰子龟登场时将全部护甲与魔抗转化为等量护甲穿透，自身护甲与魔抗降为 0。\n\n主动：骰子龟对随机敌人突刺 {C:DiceSystem.FLASH_SEG_MIN}~{C:DiceSystem.FLASH_SEG_MAX} 次，首段造成 {N:DiceSystem.FLASH_FIRST_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害，此后每段伤害为上一段的 {C:DiceSystem.FLASH_KEEP%}%。\n每穿刺一次获得 {E:DiceSystem.FLASH_SHIELD_PER_HIT*ATK} 护盾，持续 {C:DiceSystem.FLASH_SHIELD_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Passive: on spawn, Dice Turtle converts all its Armor and Magic Resist into the same amount of Armor Pen, and its Armor and Magic Resist become 0.\n\nActive: Dice Turtle dashes through random enemies {C:DiceSystem.FLASH_SEG_MIN}–{C:DiceSystem.FLASH_SEG_MAX} times. The first hit deals {N:DiceSystem.FLASH_FIRST_COEF*ATK} physical damage; each later hit deals {C:DiceSystem.FLASH_KEEP%}% of the previous one.\nEach pierce grants a {E:DiceSystem.FLASH_SHIELD_PER_HIT*ATK} shield for {C:DiceSystem.FLASH_SHIELD_SEC} seconds."

msgid "彩虹龟的棱镜每 {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_COLOR_SEC} 秒随机切换为红、蓝、绿中的一种颜色，彩虹龟的攻击会附带当前颜色的效果：红色附加真实伤害，蓝色获得护盾，绿色回复生命值。彩虹龟获得基于最大生命值的攻击力，以及基于攻击力的攻击速度。"
msgstr "Rainbow Turtle's prism switches to red, blue or green at random every {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_COLOR_SEC} seconds, and its attacks carry that color's effect: red adds true damage, blue grants a shield, green heals. Rainbow Turtle gains attack damage based on max health, and attack speed based on attack damage."

msgid "彩虹龟射出一道七彩光束，单段造成 {N:RainbowSystem.BEAM_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害，并根据当前棱镜颜色附加对应效果。"
msgstr "Rainbow Turtle fires a rainbow beam that deals {N:RainbowSystem.BEAM_COEF*ATK} physical damage and applies the current prism color's effect."

msgid "彩虹龟以棱镜之光为全体友军施加 {E:RainbowSystem.PRISM_SHIELD_SCALE*ATK} 护盾，持续 {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BLUE_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Rainbow Turtle grants all allies a {E:RainbowSystem.PRISM_SHIELD_SCALE*ATK} shield of prism light for {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BLUE_SEC} seconds."

msgid "彩虹龟在自身周围掀起七彩风暴，持续 {C:RainbowSystem.STORM_SEC} 秒。风暴每 {C:RainbowSystem.STORM_TICK_SEC} 秒对范围内的敌人造成 {M:RainbowSystem.STORM_MAGIC_COEF*ATK} 魔法伤害与 {T:RainbowSystem.STORM_TRUE_COEF*ATK} 真实伤害，并使其护甲与魔抗各降低 {C:RainbowSystem.STORM_SHRED%}%，同时为范围内的友军回复 {E:RainbowSystem.STORM_ALLY_HEAL*ATK} 生命值。"
msgstr "Rainbow Turtle whips up a rainbow storm around itself for {C:RainbowSystem.STORM_SEC} seconds. Every {C:RainbowSystem.STORM_TICK_SEC} seconds, it deals {M:RainbowSystem.STORM_MAGIC_COEF*ATK} magic damage and {T:RainbowSystem.STORM_TRUE_COEF*ATK} true damage to enemies inside, reduces their Armor and Magic Resist by {C:RainbowSystem.STORM_SHRED%}%, and heals allies inside for {E:RainbowSystem.STORM_ALLY_HEAL*ATK}."

msgid "被动：彩虹龟每 {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_PROC_SEC} 秒随机触发以下一种效果：\n橙色：全体友军获得 {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_LIFESTEAL%}% 生命偷取，持续 {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BUFF_SEC} 秒。\n黄色：对一名随机敌人施加 {E:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BURN_COEF*ATK} 层灼烧。\n青色：使一名随机敌人的攻击速度降低 {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_CHILL_DOWN%}%，持续 {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BUFF_SEC} 秒。\n紫色：对一名随机敌人施加诅咒，持续 {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BUFF_SEC} 秒，每秒造成目标 {C:BattleDamage.CURSE_HP_PCT%}% 最大生命值的真实伤害。\n\n主动：彩虹龟射出一道彩虹光，从自身开始在友军与敌人之间交替弹射 {C:RainbowSystem.REFLECT_BOUNCES} 次，命中友军时回复 {E:RainbowSystem.REFLECT_COEF*ATK} 生命值，命中敌人时造成 {M:RainbowSystem.REFLECT_COEF*ATK} 魔法伤害。"
msgstr "Passive: every {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_PROC_SEC} seconds, Rainbow Turtle triggers one of these at random:\nOrange: all allies gain {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_LIFESTEAL%}% Lifesteal for {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BUFF_SEC} seconds.\nYellow: applies {E:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BURN_COEF*ATK} Burn to a random enemy.\nCyan: reduces a random enemy's attack speed by {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_CHILL_DOWN%}% for {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BUFF_SEC} seconds.\nPurple: curses a random enemy for {C:RainbowSystem.PRISM_BUFF_SEC} seconds, dealing true damage equal to {C:BattleDamage.CURSE_HP_PCT%}% of its max health each second.\n\nActive: Rainbow Turtle fires a rainbow ray that bounces {C:RainbowSystem.REFLECT_BOUNCES} times, alternating between allies and enemies starting from itself. Allies hit heal for {E:RainbowSystem.REFLECT_COEF*ATK}; enemies hit take {M:RainbowSystem.REFLECT_COEF*ATK} magic damage."

msgid "赌神龟每次攻击后有 {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_BASE%}% 概率很快再攻击一次。连续触发时，每次触发概率乘以 {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_DECAY%}%（{C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_BASE%}% → {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_CHAIN2%}% → {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_CHAIN3%}%，以此类推），未触发时重置。"
msgstr "After each attack, Gambler Turtle has a {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_BASE%}% chance to quickly attack again. On consecutive triggers, the chance is multiplied by {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_DECAY%}% each time ({C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_BASE%}% → {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_CHAIN2%}% → {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_CHAIN3%}%, and so on), resetting when it fails."

msgid "赌神龟甩出一张扑克牌，造成 {N:GamblerSystem.CARD_ATK_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害。"
msgstr "Gambler Turtle flicks a playing card, dealing {N:GamblerSystem.CARD_ATK_COEF*ATK} physical damage."

msgid "赌神龟丢出一张万能牌，造成 {N:GamblerSystem.JOKER_DMG*ATK} 物理伤害，并使目标攻击力降低 {C:GamblerSystem.JOKER_ATK_DOWN%}%，持续 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} 秒。\n赌神龟获得 {E:GamblerSystem.JOKER_SHIELD*ATK} 护盾，直到被打破，并回复自身 {C:GamblerSystem.JOKER_HEAL%}% 最大生命值的生命值。"
msgstr "Gambler Turtle throws a Wild Card, dealing {N:GamblerSystem.JOKER_DMG*ATK} physical damage and reducing the target's attack damage by {C:GamblerSystem.JOKER_ATK_DOWN%}% for {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} seconds.\nGambler Turtle gains a {E:GamblerSystem.JOKER_SHIELD*ATK} shield until broken and heals {C:GamblerSystem.JOKER_HEAL%}% of its max health."

msgid "赌神龟消耗自身 {C:GamblerSystem.BET_HP_COST%}% 当前生命值，化作 {C:GamblerSystem.BET_SEGMENTS} 张牌打向目标，共造成约等于所消耗生命值的物理伤害（受护甲减免）。\n每张牌命中时也会判定多重打击，每次触发回复 {E:GamblerSystem.BET_MULTI_HEAL*ATK} 生命值并追加一张牌，造成 {N:GamblerSystem.CARD_ATK_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害。\n每张牌都视为一次攻击，触发攻击时的装备效果，其中多重打击追加的牌以 {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_FX%}% 效果触发。\n释放后 {C:GamblerSystem.BET_BONUS_SEC} 秒内多重打击概率提升 {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_BET_BONUS%}%。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">当前生命值低于 {C:GamblerSystem.BET_HP_COST%}% 最大生命值时，不消耗生命值也不出牌，转而回复自身 {C:GamblerSystem.BET_LOWHP_HEAL%}% 最大生命值的生命值，同样获得概率提升。</span>"
msgstr "Gambler Turtle spends {C:GamblerSystem.BET_HP_COST%}% of its current health and turns it into {C:GamblerSystem.BET_SEGMENTS} cards thrown at the target, dealing physical damage roughly equal to the health spent (reduced by armor).\nEach card hit can also trigger Multi-Strike; each trigger heals {E:GamblerSystem.BET_MULTI_HEAL*ATK} and adds a card dealing {N:GamblerSystem.CARD_ATK_COEF*ATK} physical damage.\nEach card counts as an attack and triggers on-attack item effects; extra Multi-Strike cards trigger them at {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_FX%}% effect.\nFor {C:GamblerSystem.BET_BONUS_SEC} seconds after casting, Multi-Strike chance is increased by {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_BET_BONUS%}%.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Below {C:GamblerSystem.BET_HP_COST%}% max health, it spends no health and throws no cards; instead it heals {C:GamblerSystem.BET_LOWHP_HEAL%}% of its max health and still gets the chance bonus.</span>"

msgid "被动：赌神龟登场时损失自身 {C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_HP_COST%}% 最大生命值，基础多重打击概率由 {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_BASE%}% 提升至 {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_WHEEL%}%。\n\n主动：赌神龟随机抽取一个花色，永久提升对应属性：\n♠ 黑桃：攻击力 +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_SPADE_ATK}，最大生命值 +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_SPADE_HP}\n♥ 红心：护甲 +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_HEART_RESIST}，魔抗 +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_HEART_RESIST}\n♦ 方块：暴击率 +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_DIAMOND_CRIT%}%，护甲穿透 +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_DIAMOND_PEN}\n♣ 梅花：生命偷取 +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_CLUB_LIFESTEAL%}%，攻击速度 +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_CLUB_ASPD%}%"
msgstr "Passive: on spawn, Gambler Turtle loses {C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_HP_COST%}% of its max health, and its base Multi-Strike chance rises from {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_BASE%}% to {C:GamblerSystem.MULTI_WHEEL%}%.\n\nActive: Gambler Turtle draws a random suit and permanently gains its stats:\n♠ Spades: Attack +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_SPADE_ATK}, Max Health +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_SPADE_HP}\n♥ Hearts: Armor +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_HEART_RESIST}, Magic Resist +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_HEART_RESIST}\n♦ Diamonds: Crit Chance +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_DIAMOND_CRIT%}%, Armor Pen +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_DIAMOND_PEN}\n♣ Clubs: Lifesteal +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_CLUB_LIFESTEAL%}%, Attack Speed +{C:GamblerSystem.WHEEL_CLUB_ASPD%}%"

msgid "场上有敌人生命值低于 {C:HunterSystem.EXEC_BASE%}% 时，猎人龟自动射出一支强化箭，命中时将其处决。\n猎人龟处决或击杀敌人时，窃取该敌人 {C:HunterSystem.EXEC_STEAL%}% 基础属性并获得 {C:HunterSystem.EXEC_LIFESTEAL%}% 生命偷取，持续到本战场结束。"
msgstr "When any enemy drops below {C:HunterSystem.EXEC_BASE%}% health, Hunter Turtle automatically fires an empowered arrow that executes it on hit.\nWhen Hunter Turtle executes or kills an enemy, it steals {C:HunterSystem.EXEC_STEAL%}% of that enemy's base stats and gains {C:HunterSystem.EXEC_LIFESTEAL%}% Lifesteal until the battle ends."

msgid "猎人龟射出一箭，造成 {N:HunterSystem.BASIC_ATK_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害。\n当前目标生命值低于 {C:HunterSystem.CHASE_HP_GATE%}% 时，猎人龟获得 {C:HunterSystem.CHASE_HASTE%}% 攻击速度。"
msgstr "Hunter Turtle shoots an arrow, dealing {N:HunterSystem.BASIC_ATK_COEF*ATK} physical damage.\nWhile its current target is below {C:HunterSystem.CHASE_HP_GATE%}% health, Hunter Turtle gains {C:HunterSystem.CHASE_HASTE%}% attack speed."

msgid "猎人龟瞄准目标射击，造成 {N:HunterSystem.SHOT_ATK_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害，并施加 {E:HunterSystem.SHOT_POISON_COEF*ATK} 层中毒、持续 {C:HunterSystem.SHOT_HEALCUT_SEC} 秒的 {C:HunterSystem.SHOT_HEALCUT_PCT%}% 治疗削减与猎杀印记。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">猎杀印记持续 {C:HunterSystem.MARK_SEC} 秒，期间被动的处决线提升至 {C:HunterSystem.EXEC_MARKED%}%。</span>"
msgstr "Hunter Turtle takes aim and shoots, dealing {N:HunterSystem.SHOT_ATK_COEF*ATK} physical damage and applying {E:HunterSystem.SHOT_POISON_COEF*ATK} Poison, {C:HunterSystem.SHOT_HEALCUT_PCT%}% Grievous Wounds for {C:HunterSystem.SHOT_HEALCUT_SEC} seconds, and a Hunt Mark.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Hunt Mark lasts {C:HunterSystem.MARK_SEC} seconds, raising the passive's execute threshold to {C:HunterSystem.EXEC_MARKED%}%.</span>"

msgid "猎人龟翻滚：被近战敌人贴近时斜着拉开距离，残血时撤到队友身后，目标残血时朝它翻滚，否则翻滚到与目标保持射程的位置。\n下次攻击命中时额外造成 {N:HunterSystem.ROLL_ATK_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害，并获得 {C:HunterSystem.ROLL_DODGE%}% 闪避，持续 {C:HunterSystem.ROLL_DODGE_SEC} 秒，同时获得 {E:HunterSystem.ROLL_SHIELD_COEF*ATK} 护盾。"
msgstr "Hunter Turtle rolls: diagonally away when a melee enemy closes in, behind allies when low on health, toward the target when the target is low, and otherwise to a spot at range from the target.\nIts next attack hit deals {N:HunterSystem.ROLL_ATK_COEF*ATK} bonus physical damage, and it gains {C:HunterSystem.ROLL_DODGE%}% Dodge for {C:HunterSystem.ROLL_DODGE_SEC} seconds plus a {E:HunterSystem.ROLL_SHIELD_COEF*ATK} shield."

msgid "猎人龟每 {C:HunterSystem.BARRAGE_GAP} 秒射出 1 支追踪箭，共 {C:HunterSystem.BARRAGE_ARROWS} 支，每支随机锁定一名敌人，造成 {T:HunterSystem.BARRAGE_COEF*ATK} 真实伤害。"
msgstr "Hunter Turtle fires 1 homing arrow every {C:HunterSystem.BARRAGE_GAP} seconds, {C:HunterSystem.BARRAGE_ARROWS} in total. Each locks onto a random enemy and deals {T:HunterSystem.BARRAGE_COEF*ATK} true damage."

msgid "海盗龟挥舞弯刀劈砍目标，造成 {N:PirateSystem.BLADE_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害并回复 {E:PirateSystem.BLADE_SELFHEAL*ATK} 生命值。"
msgstr "Pirate Turtle slashes the target with its cutlass, dealing {N:PirateSystem.BLADE_COEF*ATK} physical damage and healing {E:PirateSystem.BLADE_SELFHEAL*ATK}."

msgid "海盗龟命令海盗船朝随机敌人发射 {C:PirateSystem.VOLLEY_SHOTS} 发炮弹，每发对落点附近的敌人造成 {N:PirateSystem.VOLLEY_ATK_COEF*ATK} 外加 {C:PirateSystem.VOLLEY_MAXHP_PCT%}% 目标最大生命值的物理伤害。"
msgstr "Pirate Turtle orders the pirate ship to fire {C:PirateSystem.VOLLEY_SHOTS} cannonballs at random enemies. Each deals {N:PirateSystem.VOLLEY_ATK_COEF*ATK} + {C:PirateSystem.VOLLEY_MAXHP_PCT%}% of the target's max health as physical damage to enemies near where it lands."

msgid "海盗龟命令海盗船扔来一瓶朗姆酒，每秒回复 {E:HP*PirateSystem.RUM_HOT_PCT} 生命值，持续 {C:PirateSystem.RUM_SEC} 秒，合计 {E:HP*PirateSystem.RUM_HOT_TOTAL}，同时获得 {E:ATK*PirateSystem.RUM_DEF_COEF} 护甲和 {E:ATK*PirateSystem.RUM_MR_COEF} 魔抗，持续 {C:PirateSystem.RUM_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Pirate Turtle has the pirate ship toss it a bottle of rum, healing {E:HP*PirateSystem.RUM_HOT_PCT} per second for {C:PirateSystem.RUM_SEC} seconds ({E:HP*PirateSystem.RUM_HOT_TOTAL} total) and gaining {E:ATK*PirateSystem.RUM_DEF_COEF} Armor and {E:ATK*PirateSystem.RUM_MR_COEF} Magic Resist for {C:PirateSystem.RUM_SEC} seconds."

msgid "海盗龟首次龟能充满时召唤一艘海盗船。海盗船冲锋撞击目标，对其附近的敌人造成 {M:ATK} 魔法伤害并击飞 {C:PirateSystem.SHIP_CHARGE_STUN} 秒，之后留在场上攻击最近的敌人，每次造成 {N:PirateSystem.SHIP_SHOT_COEF*ATK*PirateSystem.SHIP_ATK_SCALE} 物理伤害。\n此后海盗龟每次龟能充满时朝目标扇形射出 {C:PirateSystem.SHOT_PELLETS} 颗霰弹，每颗对命中的第一个敌人造成 {N:PirateSystem.SHOT_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害并击退。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">海盗船的生命值为 {E:HP*PirateSystem.SHIP_HP_SCALE}，攻击力为 {E:ATK}，没有护甲与魔抗。</span>"
msgstr "The first time Pirate Turtle's Energy is full, it summons a pirate ship. The ship rams the target, dealing {M:ATK} magic damage to nearby enemies and knocking them up for {C:PirateSystem.SHIP_CHARGE_STUN} seconds, then stays on the field attacking the nearest enemy for {N:PirateSystem.SHIP_SHOT_COEF*ATK*PirateSystem.SHIP_ATK_SCALE} physical damage per hit.\nAfter that, each time its Energy is full, Pirate Turtle fires {C:PirateSystem.SHOT_PELLETS} pellets in a cone at the target, each dealing {N:PirateSystem.SHOT_COEF*ATK} physical damage to the first enemy hit and knocking it back.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">The pirate ship has {E:HP*PirateSystem.SHIP_HP_SCALE} health and {E:ATK} Attack, with no Armor or Magic Resist.</span>"

msgid "糖果龟挥锤砸向目标，造成 {N:CandySystem.PUNCH_ATK_COEF*ATK} 外加 {N:HP*CandySystem.PUNCH_SELF_HP} 物理伤害，并使其攻击力降低 {C:CandySystem.PUNCH_ATK_DOWN%}%，持续 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Candy Turtle smashes the target with its mallet, dealing {N:CandySystem.PUNCH_ATK_COEF*ATK} + {N:HP*CandySystem.PUNCH_SELF_HP} physical damage and reducing its attack damage by {C:CandySystem.PUNCH_ATK_DOWN%}% for {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} seconds."

msgid "糖果龟蓄力后猛砸前方直线上的敌人，总计 {N:CandySystem.HAMMER_ATK_COEF*ATK+HP*CandySystem.HAMMER_HP_PCT} 物理伤害由命中的敌人均分，并回复造成伤害 {C:CandySystem.HAMMER_LIFESTEAL%}% 的生命值。"
msgstr "Candy Turtle charges up and slams enemies in a line in front. {N:CandySystem.HAMMER_ATK_COEF*ATK+HP*CandySystem.HAMMER_HP_PCT} total physical damage is split among enemies hit, and it heals for {C:CandySystem.HAMMER_LIFESTEAL%}% of damage dealt."

msgid "糖果龟在敌方中心区域降下糖衣炮弹雨，共 {C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_TICKS} 跳，每 {C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_TICK_SEC} 秒一跳，每跳落下 {C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_SHELLS} 颗糖弹。\n每颗糖弹使落点附近的友军获得 {E:HP*CandySystem.BARRAGE_SHIELD_PCT} 护盾，持续 {C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_SHIELD_SEC} 秒，并对落点附近的敌人造成 {M:CandySystem.BARRAGE_ATK_COEF*ATK+HP*CandySystem.BARRAGE_HP_PCT} 魔法伤害，减速 {C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_SLOW_PCT%}%，持续 {C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_SLOW_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Candy Turtle rains sugarcoated shells on the center of the enemy side: {C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_TICKS} waves, one every {C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_TICK_SEC} seconds, each dropping {C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_SHELLS} shells.\nEach shell gives nearby allies a {E:HP*CandySystem.BARRAGE_SHIELD_PCT} shield for {C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_SHIELD_SEC} seconds and deals {M:CandySystem.BARRAGE_ATK_COEF*ATK+HP*CandySystem.BARRAGE_HP_PCT} magic damage to nearby enemies, slowing them by {C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_SLOW_PCT%}% for {C:CandySystem.BARRAGE_SLOW_SEC} seconds."

msgid "糖果龟登场时召唤一颗糖果炸弹，其生命值为自身 {C:CandySystem.BOMB_HP_PCT%}% 最大生命值。\n每当龟能充满，若炸弹存活，糖果龟使其生命上限提升自身 {C:CandySystem.BOMB_FEED_MAXHP_PCT%}% 最大生命值，并为其回复自身 {C:CandySystem.BOMB_FEED_HEAL_PCT%}% 最大生命值的生命值。\n若炸弹已阵亡，则召唤一颗生命值为自身 {C:CandySystem.BOMB_REVIVE_HP_PCT%}% 最大生命值的新炸弹。\n炸弹死亡时爆炸，对全体敌人均摊其 {C:CandySystem.BOMB_DEATH_AOE%}% 最大生命值的魔法伤害。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">炸弹每秒损失自身 {C:CandySystem.BOMB_DECAY_PCT%}% 最大生命值，不攻击也不移动。</span>"
msgstr "On spawn, Candy Turtle summons a Candy Bomb with health equal to {C:CandySystem.BOMB_HP_PCT%}% of its own max health.\nEach time its Energy is full, if the bomb is alive, Candy Turtle raises the bomb's max health by {C:CandySystem.BOMB_FEED_MAXHP_PCT%}% of its own max health and heals the bomb for {C:CandySystem.BOMB_FEED_HEAL_PCT%}% of its own max health.\nIf the bomb is dead, it summons a new one with {C:CandySystem.BOMB_REVIVE_HP_PCT%}% of its own max health.\nWhen the bomb dies, it explodes, splitting magic damage equal to {C:CandySystem.BOMB_DEATH_AOE%}% of its max health among all enemies.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">The bomb loses {C:CandySystem.BOMB_DECAY_PCT%}% of its max health per second and doesn't attack or move.</span>"

msgid "泡泡龟对目标连击 3 段，共造成 {N:BubbleSystem.HIT_SEG_COEF*ATK*BubbleSystem.HIT_SEGMENTS} 物理伤害。"
msgstr "Bubble Turtle hits the target 3 times, dealing {N:BubbleSystem.HIT_SEG_COEF*ATK*BubbleSystem.HIT_SEGMENTS} total physical damage."

msgid "泡泡龟使生命值最低的己方单位获得 {E:BubbleSystem.SHIELD_COEF*ATK} 护盾，持续 {C:BubbleSystem.SHIELD_SEC} 秒。\n护盾到期、被打破或持盾者阵亡时爆裂，对全体敌人造成 {M:BubbleSystem.SHIELD_BURST_COEF*ATK} 魔法伤害。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">护盾存在期间，泡泡龟的龟能停止充能。即使泡泡龟已阵亡，护盾仍会爆裂。</span>"
msgstr "Bubble Turtle gives the lowest-health ally a {E:BubbleSystem.SHIELD_COEF*ATK} shield for {C:BubbleSystem.SHIELD_SEC} seconds.\nWhen the shield expires, breaks or its holder dies, it bursts, dealing {M:BubbleSystem.SHIELD_BURST_COEF*ATK} magic damage to all enemies.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Bubble Turtle's Energy stops charging while the shield exists. The shield still bursts even if Bubble Turtle has died.</span>"

msgid "泡泡龟消耗 {C:BubbleSystem.BURST_CONSUME%}% 当前泡泡值，对目标周围的每个敌人造成相当于所消耗泡泡值 {C:BubbleSystem.BURST_MAGIC_MULT%}% 的魔法伤害，外加 {N:BubbleSystem.BURST_ATK_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害。"
msgstr "Bubble Turtle spends {C:BubbleSystem.BURST_CONSUME%}% of its current Bubbles to deal magic damage equal to {C:BubbleSystem.BURST_MAGIC_MULT%}% of the Bubbles spent, plus {N:BubbleSystem.BURST_ATK_COEF*ATK} physical damage, to each enemy around the target."

msgid "线条龟攻击目标，造成 {M:LineSystem.SKETCH_MAGIC*ATK} 魔法伤害并为其叠加 1 层墨迹。"
msgstr "Line Turtle attacks the target, dealing {M:LineSystem.SKETCH_MAGIC*ATK} magic damage and applying 1 Ink stack."

msgid "线条龟画线连接最近的 {C:LineSystem.LINK_TARGETS} 个敌人，持续 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.INK_LINK_SEC} 秒，对两个目标各造成 {N:LineSystem.LINK_ATK_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害并各叠加 1 层墨迹。\n连接期间，一方所受伤害的 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.INK_LINK_TRANSFER%}% 会以真实伤害传导给另一方，且一方获得墨迹时另一方同步获得。"
msgstr "Line Turtle draws a line linking the {C:LineSystem.LINK_TARGETS} nearest enemies for {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.INK_LINK_SEC} seconds, dealing {N:LineSystem.LINK_ATK_COEF*ATK} physical damage and applying 1 Ink stack to each.\nWhile linked, {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.INK_LINK_TRANSFER%}% of damage one takes is passed to the other as true damage, and Ink applied to one is applied to the other too."

msgid "线条龟对墨迹层数最多的敌人点下终笔，造成 {N:LineSystem.DOT_BASE_COEF*ATK} 外加每层墨迹 {N:LineSystem.DOT_PER_INK*ATK} 物理伤害。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">该伤害不消耗墨迹。</span>"
msgstr "Line Turtle adds the finishing stroke to the enemy with the most Ink, dealing {N:LineSystem.DOT_BASE_COEF*ATK} + {N:LineSystem.DOT_PER_INK*ATK} per Ink stack as physical damage.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">This doesn't consume Ink.</span>"

msgid "被动：墨迹的层数上限由 {C:LineSystem.INK_CAP} 提升至 {C:LineSystem.INK_CAP_BOMB}。\n\n主动：线条龟向敌人最密集处投掷墨水炸弹，对落点附近的敌人造成 {C:LineSystem.BOMB_SEGMENTS} 段共 {M:LineSystem.BOMB_SEG_COEF*ATK*LineSystem.BOMB_SEGMENTS} 魔法伤害，每段为目标叠加 1 层墨迹。"
msgstr "Passive: Ink's stack cap rises from {C:LineSystem.INK_CAP} to {C:LineSystem.INK_CAP_BOMB}.\n\nActive: Line Turtle throws an Ink Bomb at the densest group of enemies, dealing {M:LineSystem.BOMB_SEG_COEF*ATK*LineSystem.BOMB_SEGMENTS} magic damage over {C:LineSystem.BOMB_SEGMENTS} hits to enemies near where it lands. Each hit applies 1 Ink stack."

msgid "闪电龟每 {C:LightningSystem.SHOCK_IV} 秒自动电击一名随机敌人，造成 {T:ATK*LightningSystem.SHOCK_COEF} 真实伤害。\n敌人身上的电击达到 {C:LightningSystem.SHOCK_STACK_MAX} 层时引爆，造成 {T:ATK*LightningSystem.SHOCK_COEF} 真实伤害并重置层数。"
msgstr "Every {C:LightningSystem.SHOCK_IV} seconds, Lightning Turtle automatically shocks a random enemy for {T:ATK*LightningSystem.SHOCK_COEF} true damage.\nWhen an enemy reaches {C:LightningSystem.SHOCK_STACK_MAX} Shock stacks, they detonate for {T:ATK*LightningSystem.SHOCK_COEF} true damage and reset."

msgid "闪电龟射出一道闪电，造成 {M:LightningSystem.BOLT_ATK_COEF*ATK} 魔法伤害，随后弹跳 {C:LightningSystem.CHAIN_HOPS} 次，每段命中叠加 1 层电击。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">每跳伤害为前一跳的 {C:LightningSystem.CHAIN_DECAY%}%。</span>"
msgstr "Lightning Turtle fires a bolt dealing {M:LightningSystem.BOLT_ATK_COEF*ATK} magic damage that then bounces {C:LightningSystem.CHAIN_HOPS} times. Each hit applies 1 Shock stack.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Each bounce deals {C:LightningSystem.CHAIN_DECAY%}% of the previous one.</span>"

msgid "闪电龟在接下来的 {C:LightningSystem.SURGE_SEC} 秒内使被动电击及满层引爆的真实伤害提升 {C:LightningSystem.SURGE_BOOST%}%，并立即对目标造成 {T:ATK*LightningSystem.SURGE_HIT_COEF} 真实伤害。"
msgstr "For the next {C:LightningSystem.SURGE_SEC} seconds, Lightning Turtle's passive shocks and max-stack detonations deal {C:LightningSystem.SURGE_BOOST%}% more true damage, and it immediately deals {T:ATK*LightningSystem.SURGE_HIT_COEF} true damage to the target."

msgid "闪电龟释放 {C:LightningSystem.BARRAGE_BOLTS} 道闪电随机轰击敌方，共造成 {M:LightningSystem.BARRAGE_TOTAL*ATK} 魔法伤害，每道命中各叠加 1 层电击。"
msgstr "Lightning Turtle unleashes {C:LightningSystem.BARRAGE_BOLTS} bolts that strike random enemies, dealing {M:LightningSystem.BARRAGE_TOTAL*ATK} total magic damage. Each hit applies 1 Shock stack."

msgid "闪电龟以雷电包裹自身，获得 {E:LightningSystem.SHIELD_ATK_COEF*ATK} 外加自身最大生命值 {C:LightningSystem.SHIELD_MAXHP_PCT%}% 的护盾，持续 {C:LightningSystem.SHIELD_SEC} 秒。\n护盾存在时，闪电龟每受到一段攻击便反击 {M:LightningSystem.SHIELD_RETALIATE*ATK} 魔法伤害，并为攻击者叠加 1 层电击。"
msgstr "Lightning Turtle wraps itself in thunder, gaining a {E:LightningSystem.SHIELD_ATK_COEF*ATK} + {C:LightningSystem.SHIELD_MAXHP_PCT%}% max health shield for {C:LightningSystem.SHIELD_SEC} seconds.\nWhile the shield holds, each hit it takes strikes back for {M:LightningSystem.SHIELD_RETALIATE*ATK} magic damage and applies 1 Shock stack to the attacker."

msgid "凤凰龟首次阵亡时以 {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_HP_PCT%}% 自身最大生命值复活，并对全体敌人施加 {E:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_BURN_COEF*ATK} 层灼烧与 {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_HEALCUT%}% 治疗削减，持续 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} 秒。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">复活过程持续 {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_SHOW_SEC} 秒，期间凤凰龟无法行动、不可选中且不受伤害。</span>"
msgstr "The first time Phoenix Turtle dies, it revives with {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_HP_PCT%}% of its max health and applies {E:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_BURN_COEF*ATK} Burn and {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_HEALCUT%}% Grievous Wounds to all enemies for {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} seconds.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Reviving takes {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_SHOW_SEC} seconds, during which Phoenix Turtle can't act, is untargetable and takes no damage.</span>"

msgid "凤凰龟持续喷射火焰，每 {C:PhoenixSystem.FLAME_TICK_SEC} 秒对身前扇形内的敌人造成（{C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.PHX_FLAME_MAG_COEF%}%×攻击力×(1+攻击速度)）魔法伤害，并施加 {E:RealtimeBattle3DScene.PHX_FLAME_BURN_COEF*ATK} 层灼烧。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">喷火不受攻击间隔限制，凤凰龟可以边喷边移动。每次喷火视为一次攻击，只有扇形内离凤凰龟最近的敌人会触发攻击命中时的效果。</span>"
msgstr "Phoenix Turtle breathes fire continuously, dealing ({C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.PHX_FLAME_MAG_COEF%}% × Attack × (1 + Attack Speed)) magic damage to enemies in a cone in front every {C:PhoenixSystem.FLAME_TICK_SEC} seconds and applying {E:RealtimeBattle3DScene.PHX_FLAME_BURN_COEF*ATK} Burn.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">The flames ignore the attack interval, and Phoenix Turtle can move while breathing fire. Each tick counts as an attack; only the enemy in the cone closest to Phoenix Turtle triggers on-hit effects.</span>"

msgid "凤凰龟获得 {E:PhoenixSystem.LAVA_SHIELD_COEF*ATK} 护盾，持续 {C:PhoenixSystem.LAVA_SHIELD_SEC} 秒。\n护盾存在时，凤凰龟每受到一段攻击便反击攻击者，造成 {M:PhoenixSystem.LAVA_RETALIATE*ATK} 魔法伤害。"
msgstr "Phoenix Turtle gains a {E:PhoenixSystem.LAVA_SHIELD_COEF*ATK} shield for {C:PhoenixSystem.LAVA_SHIELD_SEC} seconds.\nWhile the shield holds, each hit it takes strikes back at the attacker for {M:PhoenixSystem.LAVA_RETALIATE*ATK} magic damage."

msgid "凤凰龟投出火球，先破坏目标 {C:PhoenixSystem.SCALD_SHIELD_BREAK%}% 护盾，再造成 {M:PhoenixSystem.SCALD_ATK_COEF*ATK} 魔法伤害并施加 {E:PhoenixSystem.SCALD_BURN_COEF*ATK} 层灼烧。\n使目标的攻击力、护甲、魔抗各降低 {C:PhoenixSystem.SCALD_STAT_DOWN%}%，并施加 {C:PhoenixSystem.SCALD_HEALCUT%}% 治疗削减，持续 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Phoenix Turtle hurls a fireball that first destroys {C:PhoenixSystem.SCALD_SHIELD_BREAK%}% of the target's shield, then deals {M:PhoenixSystem.SCALD_ATK_COEF*ATK} magic damage and applies {E:PhoenixSystem.SCALD_BURN_COEF*ATK} Burn.\nReduces the target's attack damage, Armor and Magic Resist by {C:PhoenixSystem.SCALD_STAT_DOWN%}% each and applies {C:PhoenixSystem.SCALD_HEALCUT%}% Grievous Wounds for {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.BUFF_SEC} seconds."

msgid "被动：涅槃复活时的生命值提升至 {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_ENH_HP_PCT%}% 自身最大生命值，复活后凤凰龟永久获得 {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_ENH_ATK%}% 攻击力。\n\n主动：凤凰龟获得 {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_ENH_ASPD%}% 攻击速度与 {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_ENH_SPD%}% 移动速度，持续 {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_ENH_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Passive: Rebirth revives with {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_ENH_HP_PCT%}% of max health instead, and Phoenix Turtle permanently gains {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_ENH_ATK%}% attack damage after reviving.\n\nActive: Phoenix Turtle gains {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_ENH_ASPD%}% attack speed and {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_ENH_SPD%}% move speed for {C:PhoenixSystem.NIRVANA_ENH_SEC} seconds."

msgid "石头龟每 {C:StoneSystem.BULWARK_IV} 秒获得 {E:DEF*StoneSystem.BULWARK_GAIN_PCT} 护甲，至多 {E:DEF*StoneSystem.BULWARK_CAP_PCT}。\n石头龟受到攻击或技能伤害时，将 {E:StoneSystem.REFLECT_BASE*100+DEF*StoneSystem.REFLECT_PER_DEF*100+MR*StoneSystem.REFLECT_PER_MR*100}% 的伤害反弹给攻击者。"
msgstr "Stone Turtle gains {E:DEF*StoneSystem.BULWARK_GAIN_PCT} Armor every {C:StoneSystem.BULWARK_IV} seconds, up to {E:DEF*StoneSystem.BULWARK_CAP_PCT}.\nWhen hit by attacks or abilities, Stone Turtle reflects {E:StoneSystem.REFLECT_BASE*100+DEF*StoneSystem.REFLECT_PER_DEF*100+MR*StoneSystem.REFLECT_PER_MR*100}% of the damage to the attacker."

msgid "石头龟重击当前目标，造成 {N:StoneSystem.HIT_ATK_COEF*ATK+StoneSystem.HIT_DEF_COEF*DEF+StoneSystem.HIT_MR_COEF*MR} 物理伤害。"
msgstr "Stone Turtle bashes the current target, dealing {N:StoneSystem.HIT_ATK_COEF*ATK+StoneSystem.HIT_DEF_COEF*DEF+StoneSystem.HIT_MR_COEF*MR} physical damage."

msgid "石头龟为全体友军施加 {E:StoneSystem.RS_ATK_COEF*ATK+HP*StoneSystem.RS_MAXHP_PCT} 护盾，持续 {C:StoneSystem.RS_SHIELD_SEC} 秒，并使自身护甲与魔抗各提升 {C:StoneSystem.RS_RESIST_UP%}%，持续 {C:StoneSystem.RS_RESIST_SEC} 秒。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">持有此护盾期间石头龟的龟能不再充能。</span>"
msgstr "Stone Turtle grants all allies a {E:StoneSystem.RS_ATK_COEF*ATK+HP*StoneSystem.RS_MAXHP_PCT} shield for {C:StoneSystem.RS_SHIELD_SEC} seconds and increases its own Armor and Magic Resist by {C:StoneSystem.RS_RESIST_UP%}% for {C:StoneSystem.RS_RESIST_SEC} seconds.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Stone Turtle's Energy doesn't charge while it holds this shield.</span>"

msgid "被动：石头龟每次受到攻击或技能伤害获得 1 层岩层，至多 {C:StoneSystem.ROCK_LAYER_CAP} 层。每层岩层提供 {C:StoneSystem.ROCK_DR_PER_LAYER%}% 减伤与 {C:StoneSystem.ROCK_SIZE_PER_LAYER%}% 体型。\n\n主动：石头龟向前释放岩石冲击波，对前方一排敌人造成 {N:(StoneSystem.ROCK_WAVE_DEF_COEF*DEF+StoneSystem.ROCK_WAVE_MR_COEF*MR)*(1+StoneSystem.ROCK_WAVE_PER_LAYER*rockLayers)} 物理伤害，将其击退并眩晕 {C:StoneSystem.ROCK_WAVE_STUN} 秒。"
msgstr "Passive: each time Stone Turtle takes attack or ability damage, it gains 1 Rock Layer, up to {C:StoneSystem.ROCK_LAYER_CAP}. Each layer grants {C:StoneSystem.ROCK_DR_PER_LAYER%}% Damage Reduction and {C:StoneSystem.ROCK_SIZE_PER_LAYER%}% size.\n\nActive: Stone Turtle sends out a rock shockwave that deals {N:(StoneSystem.ROCK_WAVE_DEF_COEF*DEF+StoneSystem.ROCK_WAVE_MR_COEF*MR)*(1+StoneSystem.ROCK_WAVE_PER_LAYER*rockLayers)} physical damage to the row of enemies in front, knocking them back and stunning them for {C:StoneSystem.ROCK_WAVE_STUN} seconds."

msgid "石头龟嘲讽附近的所有敌人 {C:StoneSystem.TAUNT_SEC} 秒，并获得 {E:StoneSystem.TAUNT_SHIELD_COEF*ATK} 护盾与 {E:minf(DEF*StoneSystem.TAUNT_DR_PER_DEF,StoneSystem.TAUNT_DR_CAP*100)}% 减伤，持续 {C:StoneSystem.TAUNT_SEC} 秒。\n{C:StoneSystem.SLAM_DELAY} 秒后，石头龟猛砸地面，对附近的敌人造成 {M:StoneSystem.SLAM_ATK_COEF*ATK} 魔法伤害并将其击飞 {C:StoneSystem.SLAM_KNOCK_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Stone Turtle taunts all nearby enemies for {C:StoneSystem.TAUNT_SEC} seconds and gains a {E:StoneSystem.TAUNT_SHIELD_COEF*ATK} shield and {E:minf(DEF*StoneSystem.TAUNT_DR_PER_DEF,StoneSystem.TAUNT_DR_CAP*100)}% Damage Reduction for {C:StoneSystem.TAUNT_SEC} seconds.\nAfter {C:StoneSystem.SLAM_DELAY} seconds, it slams the ground, dealing {M:StoneSystem.SLAM_ATK_COEF*ATK} magic damage to nearby enemies and knocking them up for {C:StoneSystem.SLAM_KNOCK_SEC} seconds."

msgid "熔岩龟将造成伤害的 {C:LavaSystem.RAGE_GAIN_PCT%}% 与承受伤害的 {C:LavaSystem.RAGE_GAIN_PCT%}% 转化为怒气。\n怒气满 {rageMax} 时变身为火山龟，持续 {transformDuration} 秒：转为近战，属性提升，技能替换为火山技能，并在变身时砸地击飞敌人。"
msgstr "Lava Turtle converts {C:LavaSystem.RAGE_GAIN_PCT%}% of damage dealt and {C:LavaSystem.RAGE_GAIN_PCT%}% of damage taken into Rage.\nAt {rageMax} Rage, it transforms into Volcano Turtle for {transformDuration} seconds: it becomes melee, gains stats, its abilities are replaced with Volcano abilities, and it slams the ground on transforming to knock up enemies."

msgid "熔岩龟投出熔岩弹，造成 {M:LavaSystem.BOLT_MAGIC*ATK} + {C:LavaSystem.BOLT_TGT_HP%}%目标最大生命值的魔法伤害，并施加（{C:LavaSystem.BOLT_BURN_COEF%}% 攻击力）层灼烧。"
msgstr "Lava Turtle hurls a lava ball that deals {M:LavaSystem.BOLT_MAGIC*ATK} + {C:LavaSystem.BOLT_TGT_HP%}% of the target's max health as magic damage and applies ({C:LavaSystem.BOLT_BURN_COEF%}% Attack) Burn."

msgid "熔岩龟在敌人最密集处生成一片岩浆池，持续 {C:LavaSystem.QUAKE_SEC} 秒。\n岩浆池每 {C:LavaSystem.QUAKE_TICK_SEC} 秒对池内的敌人造成 {M:LavaSystem.QUAKE_ATK_COEF*ATK} 外加目标 {C:LavaSystem.QUAKE_TGT_HP%}% 最大生命值的魔法伤害，并使其减速 {C:LavaSystem.QUAKE_SLOW_PCT%}%、魔抗降低 {C:LavaSystem.QUAKE_MR_DOWN%}%。"
msgstr "Lava Turtle creates a magma pool at the densest group of enemies for {C:LavaSystem.QUAKE_SEC} seconds.\nEvery {C:LavaSystem.QUAKE_TICK_SEC} seconds, the pool deals {M:LavaSystem.QUAKE_ATK_COEF*ATK} + {C:LavaSystem.QUAKE_TGT_HP%}% of the target's max health as magic damage to enemies inside, slows them by {C:LavaSystem.QUAKE_SLOW_PCT%}% and reduces their Magic Resist by {C:LavaSystem.QUAKE_MR_DOWN%}%."

msgid "熔岩龟蓄力后使目标脚下喷出岩浆柱，击飞附近的敌人并对目标造成 {M:LavaSystem.SURGE_ATK_COEF*ATK} 魔法伤害，熔岩龟获得 {E:LavaSystem.SURGE_SHIELD_COEF*ATK} 护盾。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">护盾直到被打破。</span>"
msgstr "Lava Turtle charges up and erupts a magma pillar under the target, knocking up nearby enemies and dealing {M:LavaSystem.SURGE_ATK_COEF*ATK} magic damage to the target. Lava Turtle gains a {E:LavaSystem.SURGE_SHIELD_COEF*ATK} shield.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">The shield lasts until broken.</span>"

msgid "普通形态：熔岩龟冲刺，残血或被敌人贴身时向后撤离，否则贴近目标。随后立即进行下一次攻击，这发熔岩弹贯穿全场，对沿途每名敌人造成 {M:LavaSystem.PIERCE_ATK_COEF*ATK} 外加目标 {C:LavaSystem.PIERCE_MAXHP_PCT%}% 最大生命值的魔法伤害，并施加 {E:LavaSystem.PIERCE_BURN_COEF*ATK} 层灼烧。\n\n火山形态：火山龟获得 {C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_HP_PCT%}% 自身最大生命值、{C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_HASTE%}% 攻击速度与 {C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_SPD%}% 移动速度，持续 {C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_SEC} 秒。"
msgstr "Normal Form: Lava Turtle dashes, backing off when low on health or when an enemy is close, otherwise closing in on the target. It immediately attacks again, and this lava ball pierces across the whole field, dealing {M:LavaSystem.PIERCE_ATK_COEF*ATK} + {C:LavaSystem.PIERCE_MAXHP_PCT%}% of the target's max health as magic damage to every enemy in its path and applying {E:LavaSystem.PIERCE_BURN_COEF*ATK} Burn.\n\nVolcano Form: gains {C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_HP_PCT%}% of max health, {C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_HASTE%}% attack speed and {C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_SPD%}% move speed for {C:LavaSystem.RAMPAGE_SEC} seconds."

msgid "火山形态下攻击变为烈焰重击：造成 {M:LavaSystem.MELEE_MAGIC*ATK} + {C:LavaSystem.MELEE_SELF_HP%}%自身最大生命值的魔法伤害，并施加（{C:LavaSystem.BOLT_BURN_COEF%}% 攻击力）层灼烧。\n射程缩短为 {C:LavaSystem.VOLCANO_RANGE} 码，转为近战。"
msgstr "In Volcano Form, attacks become Blazing Strikes: they deal {M:LavaSystem.MELEE_MAGIC*ATK} + {C:LavaSystem.MELEE_SELF_HP%}% of own max health as magic damage and apply ({C:LavaSystem.BOLT_BURN_COEF%}% Attack) Burn.\nRange drops to {C:LavaSystem.VOLCANO_RANGE} and it becomes melee."

msgid "火山龟召来一道熔岩浪，从敌人那一侧横扫过整个场地。熔岩浪每扫过一名敌人，便将其击飞，造成 {M:LavaSystem.ERUPT_ATK_COEF*ATK} 魔法伤害并施加 {E:LavaSystem.ERUPT_BURN_COEF*ATK} 层灼烧，火山龟回复 {C:LavaSystem.ERUPT_HEAL_PCT%}% 自身最大生命值。"
msgstr "Volcano Turtle calls a lava wave that sweeps across the whole field from the enemy side. Each enemy it passes is knocked up, takes {M:LavaSystem.ERUPT_ATK_COEF*ATK} magic damage and gets {E:LavaSystem.ERUPT_BURN_COEF*ATK} Burn, and Volcano Turtle heals {C:LavaSystem.ERUPT_HEAL_PCT%}% of its max health."

msgid "火山龟蓄力猛砸目标，将其击飞，造成 {N:LavaSystem.STRIKE_ATK_COEF*ATK} + {C:LavaSystem.STRIKE_MAXHP_PCT%}%自身最大生命值的物理伤害，并附带 {C:LavaSystem.STRIKE_LIFESTEAL%}% 生命偷取。"
msgstr "Volcano Turtle charges up and slams the target, knocking it up and dealing {N:LavaSystem.STRIKE_ATK_COEF*ATK} + {C:LavaSystem.STRIKE_MAXHP_PCT%}% of own max health as physical damage, with {C:LavaSystem.STRIKE_LIFESTEAL%}% Lifesteal."

msgid "赛博龟每 {C:CyberSystem.DRONE_SPAWN_SEC} 秒生成 1 个浮游炮，每个浮游炮每 {C:CyberSystem.DRONE_FIRE_SEC} 秒攻击一名随机敌人，造成 {N:CyberSystem.DRONE_SHOT_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害。\n赛博龟阵亡时，所有浮游炮各发射一道贯穿激光，造成 {M:CyberSystem.VOLLEY_COEF*ATK} 魔法伤害，随后组装为一台近战机甲继续战斗。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">浮游炮至多 {C:CyberSystem.DRONE_CAP} 个，不可被选中。赛博龟被控制时浮游炮停火。</span>"
msgstr "Cyber Turtle creates 1 drone every {C:CyberSystem.DRONE_SPAWN_SEC} seconds. Each drone attacks a random enemy every {C:CyberSystem.DRONE_FIRE_SEC} seconds for {N:CyberSystem.DRONE_SHOT_COEF*ATK} physical damage.\nWhen Cyber Turtle dies, every drone fires a piercing laser dealing {M:CyberSystem.VOLLEY_COEF*ATK} magic damage, then they assemble into a melee mech that keeps fighting.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Up to {C:CyberSystem.DRONE_CAP} drones, which are untargetable. Drones stop firing while Cyber Turtle is crowd-controlled.</span>"

msgid "赛博龟射出一道贯穿激光，对第一个命中的敌人造成 {N:CyberSystem.LASER_FIRST_COEF*ATK} 物理伤害，之后命中的每个敌人受到 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.CYBER_LASER_FALLOFF%}% 的伤害。"
msgstr "Cyber Turtle fires a piercing laser that deals {N:CyberSystem.LASER_FIRST_COEF*ATK} physical damage to the first enemy hit; each enemy after that takes {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.CYBER_LASER_FALLOFF%}% of the damage."

msgid "赛博龟蓄力后朝一条直线发射能量射线，对直线上的所有敌人造成 {N:CyberSystem.CANNON_PHYS*ATK} 物理伤害，每个浮游炮额外附加 {T:CyberSystem.CANNON_TRUE_PER_DRONE*ATK} 真实伤害。"
msgstr "Cyber Turtle charges up and fires an energy ray in a line, dealing {N:CyberSystem.CANNON_PHYS*ATK} physical damage to all enemies on it, plus {T:CyberSystem.CANNON_TRUE_PER_DRONE*ATK} true damage per drone."

msgid "赛博龟侵入一名随机敌人，使其倒戈为赛博龟一方作战，持续 {C:CyberSystem.HIJACK_SEC} 秒。侵入期间赛博龟的龟能锁定，不再充能。\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">龟蛋与免疫控制的单位不会被侵入。</span>"
msgstr "Cyber Turtle hacks a random enemy, making it fight for Cyber Turtle's side for {C:CyberSystem.HIJACK_SEC} seconds. Cyber Turtle's Energy is locked and doesn't charge during the hack.\n<span style=\"color:#8a93a0\">Turtle Eggs and units immune to crowd control can't be hacked.</span>"
